Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:46.13,ENG,2,0,0,0,,DOMINICAN REPUBLIC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:59.39,ENG,3,0,0,0,,All right, we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.51,0:01:02.31,ENG,4,0,0,0,,- You got this? - You bet your ass, bubba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.81,ENG,5,0,0,0,,Let's make some money!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.19,ENG,6,0,0,0,,Everyone in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:16.86,ENG,7,0,0,0,,l thought we'd be robbing banks by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:19.32,ENG,8,0,0,0,,not some gas truck in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:22.08,ENG,9,0,0,0,,Down here, gas is gold, bubba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:25.24,ENG,10,0,0,0,,Yeah, But banks don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:29.88,ENG,11,0,0,0,,Anytime you get near a bank...we have to break your ass out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:32.84,ENG,12,0,0,0,,Kill the chatter! Game time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:35.26,ENG,13,0,0,0,,l wouldn't piss him off, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:52.40,ENG,14,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.55,ENG,15,0,0,0,,Hey, you greedy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.15,ENG,16,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, we're gonna have to hit this hard and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.07,ENG,17,0,0,0,,We got four K left before the downgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.01,ENG,18,0,0,0,,Locked and loaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.92,ENG,19,0,0,0,,This is all you, Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:59.01,ENG,20,0,0,0,,Liquid gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:07.35,ENG,21,0,0,0,,We're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.60,ENG,22,0,0,0,,Okay, T, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:15.69,ENG,23,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can get it under six tries this time, huh, T?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:18.82,ENG,24,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? I'll do it in one try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.03,ENG,25,0,0,0,,Lt's more like three. Come on, Tego, keep it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:42.22,ENG,26,0,0,0,,Just one K left. We're running out of road. Get in there, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:44.13,ENG,27,0,0,0,,I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:54.60,ENG,28,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:02.69,ENG,29,0,0,0,,T, cut loose! Unhitch, unhitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.84,ENG,30,0,0,0,,- Don't be crazy.lose your load! - What do you think I'm trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:28.35,ENG,31,0,0,0,,...idiot,just release!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:51.95,ENG,32,0,0,0,,- Spray that hitch! - I don't have a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.54,ENG,33,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.55,ENG,34,0,0,0,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.14,ENG,35,0,0,0,,No shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.52,ENG,36,0,0,0,,Hold onto something tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.67,ENG,37,0,0,0,,Letty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:43.00,ENG,38,0,0,0,,- Give me your hand! - I can't reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.76,ENG,39,0,0,0,,You got to jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.16,ENG,40,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.16,ENG,41,0,0,0,,Letty, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:21.29,ENG,42,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:55.70,ENG,43,0,0,0,,Dom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.25,ENG,44,0,0,0,,Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.50,ENG,45,0,0,0,,Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:08.78,ENG,47,0,0,0,,Mi primo is running security on the airbase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:12.20,ENG,48,0,0,0,,Says that there's going to be a couple of refueling planes arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.87,ENG,49,0,0,0,,HAN: How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.12,ENG,50,0,0,0,,OMAR: Money, money!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.62,ENG,51,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:27.17,ENG,52,0,0,0,,OMAR: Yo, why your stack is bigger than mine always?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:29.09,ENG,53,0,0,0,,I'm supersized, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.26,ENG,54,0,0,0,,Go have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:41.72,ENG,55,0,0,0,,Cops just raided our garage in Baracoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:45.06,ENG,56,0,0,0,,They were real interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:50.40,ENG,57,0,0,0,,Heat's on and we just sent up a flare that's gonna lead them right to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:53.57,ENG,58,0,0,0,,l say we move out first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:56.99,ENG,59,0,0,0,,Nah, it's me they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.57,ENG,60,0,0,0,,And if they catch me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:02.66,ENG,61,0,0,0,,they're throwing big numbers at anybody with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:07.79,ENG,62,0,0,0,,Han, we had a good run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.55,ENG,63,0,0,0,,Time for you to go do your own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:19.47,ENG,64,0,0,0,,Heard they're doing some crazy shit in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.69,ENG,65,0,0,0,,Have you seen Letty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.08,ENG,66,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.79,ENG,67,0,0,0,,I hear Rio is nice this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.72,ENG,68,0,0,0,,The cops are getting hungrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:59.22,ENG,69,0,0,0,,Then I guess we're doing our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:05.93,ENG,70,0,0,0,,I'm a walking target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:09.81,ENG,71,0,0,0,,I don't want you around when they catch up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:14.40,ENG,72,0,0,0,,"Ride or die," remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.53,ENG,73,0,0,0,,Dom, how long have we been doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:24.37,ENG,74,0,0,0,,And now all of a sudden, out of nowhere, it's too dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.54,ENG,75,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.63,ENG,76,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out. We always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.62,ENG,77,0,0,0,,DOWNTOWN LOS ANGELES
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:02.84,ENG,78,0,0,0,,- I don't know shit! - Give me a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.00,ENG,79,0,0,0,,- I don't know shit, man! - Give me a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:08.09,ENG,80,0,0,0,,David Park! David Park's the guy you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:09.80,ENG,81,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.81,ENG,82,0,0,0,,Thank God. Listen, he's in a mood because yesterday was his cheat day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.86,ENG,83,0,0,0,,and then today, some genius brought in donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.15,ENG,84,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.07,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:32.70,ENG,86,0,0,0,,Complaints keep rolling in after your little downtown Olympics, O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:35.95,ENG,87,0,0,0,,Tell me that reinstating you wasn't a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:39.21,ENG,88,0,0,0,,- I got a name. David Park. - That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:41.75,ENG,89,0,0,0,,That's all you got? David Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:44.71,ENG,90,0,0,0,,I could throw a fortune cookie out this window and hit 50 David Parks right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.46,ENG,91,0,0,0,,- It's Korean, not Chinese. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:52.72,ENG,92,0,0,0,,Park is a scout that recruits street racers to be mules for the Braga cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:55.39,ENG,93,0,0,0,,We find Park, and we bust the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:04.09,ENG,94,0,0,0,,PANAMA CITY,PANAMA
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.71,ENG,95,0,0,0,,Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:24.46,ENG,96,0,0,0,,Mia, I told you not to call me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.67,ENG,97,0,0,0,,Dom, it's Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.46,ENG,98,0,0,0,,She's been murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:49.61,ENG,99,0,0,0,,We have gathered here to pay our final respects to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:52.86,ENG,100,0,0,0,,Let us reflect on her journey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:16:01.33,ENG,101,0,0,0,,"The Lord is my shepherd, I shall not want. He makes me lie down..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:23.98,ENG,102,0,0,0,,Facial recognition software matched Toretto
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.90,ENG,103,0,0,0,,about 10 minutes after he crossed the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.48,ENG,104,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.57,ENG,105,0,0,0,,I thought he'd show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:30.08,ENG,106,0,0,0,,I told you not to come. They're staking the place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:32.63,ENG,107,0,0,0,,- If they find you... - They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:38.63,ENG,108,0,0,0,,Come on. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:07.37,ENG,109,0,0,0,,Letty wouldn't let them junk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.54,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Even though it is a goddamn curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:17.30,ENG,111,0,0,0,,When she came back, she was always in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.84,ENG,112,0,0,0,,working on it day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:28.10,ENG,113,0,0,0,,It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.69,ENG,114,0,0,0,,It was like she knew you were coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:37.07,ENG,115,0,0,0,,I want to see the crash site.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:46.16,ENG,116,0,0,0,,I just got off the phone with Deputy Director Lawson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:50.29,ENG,117,0,0,0,,If we don't make serious inroads into the Braga case in the next 72 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.63,ENG,118,0,0,0,,they're gonna shut us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:56.34,ENG,119,0,0,0,,I know I'm a newbie here, but why the clock now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:58.21,ENG,120,0,0,0,,Because it's been two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.80,ENG,121,0,0,0,,and the last three agents we sent to infiltrate his organization
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.26,ENG,122,0,0,0,,came back in body bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:07.93,ENG,123,0,0,0,,He's moved more heroin across the border than Escobar did in 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.81,ENG,124,0,0,0,,This guy is becoming one of our biggest national threats,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.98,ENG,125,0,0,0,,and we don't even have a picture of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:16.57,ENG,126,0,0,0,,We don't have prints! Not even a goddamn DOB!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.82,ENG,127,0,0,0,,What's the status on David Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:24.12,ENG,128,0,0,0,,lsn't he our ticket into the Braga organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:27.99,ENG,129,0,0,0,,We're running the name through city and county databases, sorting the possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.00,ENG,130,0,0,0,,We've got over 500 already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:33.12,ENG,131,0,0,0,,Park's insignificant. Sounds like another jerk-off to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:37.17,ENG,132,0,0,0,,It's not. Without Park, Braga wouldn't have drivers to move his shipments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:40.01,ENG,133,0,0,0,,Cross-check traffic. lllegal modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:44.43,ENG,134,0,0,0,,Street racing. This guy will definitely have a record. We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:46.72,ENG,135,0,0,0,,We better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:49.06,ENG,136,0,0,0,, What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:52.81,ENG,137,0,0,0,,Your boy Toretto's red Chevelle has been spotted in his old neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.69,ENG,138,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring his ass in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:57.02,ENG,139,0,0,0,,Not in your car you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:07.66,ENG,140,0,0,0,,It's straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:15.75,ENG,141,0,0,0,,You found something back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.25,ENG,142,0,0,0,,There were burn marks on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:29.59,ENG,143,0,0,0,,The kind that could only be caused by nitrometh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:36.60,ENG,144,0,0,0,,There's only one guy in all of L.A. that sells that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:43.81,ENG,145,0,0,0,,Nothing you can do is gonna bring her back, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.19,ENG,146,0,0,0,,If I were Letty, I would ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.28,0:22:51.86,ENG,147,0,0,0,,No, I would beg you, please, let this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:55.12,ENG,148,0,0,0,,Before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.62,0:23:01.54,ENG,149,0,0,0,,It's already too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.51,ENG,150,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.49,0:24:16.99,ENG,151,0,0,0,,Miss Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:20.24,ENG,152,0,0,0,,I'm Michael Stasiak, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:23.37,ENG,153,0,0,0,,Let's you and I have a little chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:47.73,ENG,154,0,0,0,,Hi. This is Forsythe in Evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.81,0:24:51.44,ENG,155,0,0,0,,I need Stasiak down here right away to sign some greenies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.53,0:24:53.03,ENG,156,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:54.65,ENG,157,0,0,0,,Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:57.32,ENG,158,0,0,0,,Okay, I narrowed it down to 50 or so David Parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:59.78,ENG,159,0,0,0,,What I'd like you to do is run the make and model on each one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.87,0:25:00.83,ENG,160,0,0,0,,- All right? - Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:02.16,ENG,161,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.80,0:25:15.09,ENG,162,0,0,0,,Hey, Tyler, we got a transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:19.30,ENG,163,0,0,0,,You want to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:41.99,ENG,164,0,0,0,,Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.33,0:25:44.87,ENG,165,0,0,0,,When'd you get back in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.96,0:25:47.83,ENG,166,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a car you did an engine mod on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:52.42,ENG,167,0,0,0,,Nitromethane tank. Ford full-size. Continental tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:57.68,ENG,168,0,0,0,,Look, what are you doing, coming in here like this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:00.89,ENG,169,0,0,0,,This ain't your scene anymore, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.97,0:26:03.68,ENG,170,0,0,0,,Don't ever put your hands on me again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.77,0:26:06.10,ENG,171,0,0,0,,Say hi to your sister for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.65,0:26:20.99,ENG,172,0,0,0,,A Korean kid brought it in. David Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:24.16,ENG,173,0,0,0,,It's a green Ford Torino.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:27.50,ENG,174,0,0,0,,Please don't drop this on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.38,0:26:34.09,ENG,175,0,0,0,,I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.38,0:26:39.84,ENG,176,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me why you dragged me here, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.97,0:26:49.85,ENG,177,0,0,0,,You know they're going to capture Dom. Maybe worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:55.86,ENG,178,0,0,0,,I don't want you getting tangled up in this. So stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.78,0:27:00.15,ENG,179,0,0,0,,That's what you have to say to me after five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.53,0:27:04.37,ENG,180,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, you care what happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:10.12,ENG,181,0,0,0,,What I did to you was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.21,0:27:14.50,ENG,182,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It was... It was the hardest thing I've ever had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.96,0:27:17.88,ENG,183,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.51,0:27:23.26,ENG,184,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry that you had to come into my home and pretend to love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.35,0:27:25.72,ENG,185,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry that you ripped my family apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.81,0:27:28.72,ENG,186,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry that that was hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.44,0:27:34.06,ENG,187,0,0,0,,I lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:38.07,ENG,188,0,0,0,,I lied to Dom. I lied to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:41.82,ENG,189,0,0,0,,That's what I do best. It's why the Feds recruited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.49,0:27:45.87,ENG,190,0,0,0,,Maybe you're lying to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:50.83,ENG,191,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not the good guy pretending to be a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:54.67,ENG,192,0,0,0,,Maybe you're the bad guy pretending to be the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.92,ENG,193,0,0,0,,You ever think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:28:00.05,ENG,194,0,0,0,,Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:14.27,ENG,195,0,0,0,,I always wondered,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:19.27,ENG,196,0,0,0,,why did you let my brother go that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:22.28,ENG,197,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.21,0:28:33.62,ENG,198,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.75,0:28:37.75,ENG,199,0,0,0,,Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:40.84,ENG,200,0,0,0,,I got the cross-checks on David Park back and have a list of possibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.96,0:28:43.38,ENG,201,0,0,0,,- What do you got? - All right. A 45-year-old male in a '06 Scion
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.47,0:28:45.55,ENG,202,0,0,0,,- with three reckless driving tickets. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:48.01,ENG,203,0,0,0,,- An '01 Chevy Tahoe. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:51.93,ENG,204,0,0,0,,Two Mini Coopers, a '06 and a '07, a Toyota hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.02,0:28:54.69,ENG,205,0,0,0,,- Hell no. - A '98 Saturn, a '95 Sebring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:56.90,ENG,206,0,0,0,,A '98 Nissan 240 with an illegal mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.98,ENG,207,0,0,0,,Wait. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:01.57,ENG,208,0,0,0,,- What? - The 240 with the illegal mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.69,0:29:04.95,ENG,209,0,0,0,,- How do you know? - 'Cause that's something I'd drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:30.85,ENG,210,0,0,0,,Don't! Don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.48,0:29:45.19,ENG,211,0,0,0,,Green Torino, running nitro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:47.82,ENG,212,0,0,0,,- Whose car? - I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.91,0:29:50.91,ENG,213,0,0,0,,I'm just the middleman. I swear! I'm just the middleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.75,0:29:57.46,ENG,214,0,0,0,, Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.04,0:30:01.84,ENG,215,0,0,0,,I don't know shit, man. I swear. I just run cars for Braga, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.92,0:30:04.71,ENG,216,0,0,0,,All I can do is get you in the race! That's all I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:06.17,ENG,217,0,0,0,,What race?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.64,0:30:13.39,ENG,218,0,0,0,,Help! Come on, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:15.85,ENG,219,0,0,0,,Let me up, man! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.03,0:30:29.86,ENG,220,0,0,0,,Come on, man, I don't know shit! Just let me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.95,0:30:32.12,ENG,221,0,0,0,,I told you, you got to talk to Braga!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:33.16,ENG,222,0,0,0,,Bring him up, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:35.95,ENG,223,0,0,0,,God! Don't drop me! That's all I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:38.54,ENG,224,0,0,0,,Bring him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.62,0:30:41.12,ENG,225,0,0,0,,You here to take me in, O'Conner?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.58,0:30:44.13,ENG,226,0,0,0,,- Shit! Shit! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.01,0:30:48.72,ENG,227,0,0,0,,Letty was my friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:50.43,ENG,228,0,0,0,,You weren't anyone's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.51,0:30:53.64,ENG,229,0,0,0,,Yo, can you guys talk about this later? Now pull my ass up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:56.01,ENG,230,0,0,0,,She was running for this guy, Braga, and things went bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:57.14,ENG,231,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.23,0:30:59.85,ENG,232,0,0,0,,I'm going to get these guys, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:02.15,ENG,233,0,0,0,,Now let me do my job and bring him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.23,0:31:04.69,ENG,234,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill this Braga.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:07.82,ENG,235,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.24,0:31:10.99,ENG,236,0,0,0,,And anyone else who gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.24,0:31:16.45,ENG,237,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:18.66,ENG,238,0,0,0,,Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.55,0:31:28.84,ENG,239,0,0,0,,O'Conner!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.59,0:31:34.26,ENG,240,0,0,0,,O'Conner! If you ever release a witness of mine again...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:40.56,ENG,241,0,0,0,,- That's enough! - Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.64,0:31:42.06,ENG,242,0,0,0,,- I'm fine! - That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:45.36,ENG,243,0,0,0,,- You're through, O'Conner! - I said that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.86,0:31:48.40,ENG,244,0,0,0,,Stasiak, go get yourself cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:50.74,ENG,245,0,0,0,,What? He hit me first! You...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.82,0:31:52.82,ENG,246,0,0,0,,This isn't the Cub Scouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.91,0:31:56.16,ENG,247,0,0,0,,Now, go on! You're bleeding on my floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.75,0:32:08.59,ENG,248,0,0,0,,O'Conner, do you know the difference between a cop and a criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:11.09,ENG,249,0,0,0,,- What? - One bad judgment call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.59,0:32:14.76,ENG,250,0,0,0,,Keep your shit in line, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.72,0:32:20.47,ENG,251,0,0,0,,Have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.48,0:32:25.15,ENG,252,0,0,0,,Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.07,0:32:33.70,ENG,253,0,0,0,,Good news. We have intel that Braga's number two, Ramon Campos,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.78,0:32:35.95,ENG,254,0,0,0,,will hold a street race in Koreatown tomorrow night
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.03,0:32:38.20,ENG,255,0,0,0,,to fill a slot on his team.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.74,0:32:41.41,ENG,256,0,0,0,,They've already chosen three drivers from previous races.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.91,0:32:45.04,ENG,257,0,0,0,,Our newest informant, Mr. David Park,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.12,0:32:47.88,ENG,258,0,0,0,,has been kind enough to get us into the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:52.59,ENG,259,0,0,0,,O'Conner, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.42,0:32:56.01,ENG,260,0,0,0,,Let me guess, winner gets the slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:04.31,ENG,261,0,0,0,,All right, so these are all the imports the city has in impound.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.39,0:33:06.52,ENG,262,0,0,0,,- Okay, nice. - Pick your poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:09.82,ENG,263,0,0,0,,All right, 2206. I crashed one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.90,0:33:14.57,ENG,264,0,0,0,,3418 and 2765.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.91,0:33:17.86,ENG,265,0,0,0,,Okay, so which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.95,0:33:19.66,ENG,266,0,0,0,,I want them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:51.44,ENG,267,0,0,0,,Standard issue tracking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:53.44,ENG,268,0,0,0,,Boss wants to know where you are at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:47.16,ENG,269,0,0,0,,You want to play with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.16,0:34:49.29,ENG,270,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.67,0:34:52.08,ENG,271,0,0,0,, What are you looking at, nutsack?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:53.92,ENG,272,0,0,0,,I don't know. You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.00,0:34:56.25,ENG,273,0,0,0,,The racer wants what Dwight's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:59.30,ENG,274,0,0,0,,See, but, ladies, Dwight's already on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.34,ENG,275,0,0,0,,You got to be fast if you want to drive for Braga.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.43,0:35:04.26,ENG,276,0,0,0,,- Is there a problem here? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.77,0:35:08.77,ENG,277,0,0,0,,You one of Park's guys, blondie?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.85,0:35:10.35,ENG,278,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.10,0:35:12.56,ENG,279,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:17.69,ENG,280,0,0,0,, See you later, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.49,0:35:19.69,ENG,281,0,0,0,,You, too, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:34.21,ENG,282,0,0,0,,BulI's-eye, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.26,0:35:41.47,ENG,283,0,0,0,,We can do this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:49.02,ENG,284,0,0,0,,You all know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.68,0:35:51.18,ENG,285,0,0,0,,Good drivers
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.85,0:35:54.65,ENG,286,0,0,0,,are a dime a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:59.36,ENG,287,0,0,0,,Man, every corner's got a chingadera tuner racing for pinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.19,0:36:03.20,ENG,288,0,0,0,,That's not what Braga has got me looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.78,0:36:08.45,ENG,289,0,0,0,,Braga wants someone that would sell their abuelita to be behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:14.12,ENG,290,0,0,0,,Someone that drives their 10-second cars not in a straight line,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.21,0:36:18.42,ENG,291,0,0,0,,but to push it and make it through places no one else would take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:20.71,ENG,292,0,0,0,,Real drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.84,0:36:24.93,ENG,293,0,0,0,,So, what are we hauling?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.93,0:36:29.35,ENG,294,0,0,0,,For the money Braga's paying, you don't need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.43,0:36:32.10,ENG,295,0,0,0,,You just said you wanted real drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:37.27,ENG,296,0,0,0,,A real driver knows exactly what's in his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.32,0:36:44.11,ENG,297,0,0,0,,Mira, real driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.99,0:36:48.20,ENG,298,0,0,0,,nobody's forcing you to race.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.28,0:36:50.04,ENG,299,0,0,0,,You the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.79,0:36:54.08,ENG,300,0,0,0,,Or am I talking to the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.04,0:36:58.96,ENG,301,0,0,0,,Do I look like a boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.17,0:37:04.72,ENG,302,0,0,0,,My job is to find the best drivers, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:08.47,ENG,303,0,0,0,,Whoever wins the race gets the info. We cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.39,0:37:14.94,ENG,304,0,0,0,,Are we cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.15,0:37:18.81,ENG,305,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.32,0:37:21.32,ENG,306,0,0,0,,No, we ain't cool, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.03,0:37:24.19,ENG,307,0,0,0,,Who's closing these streets?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.49,0:37:28.57,ENG,308,0,0,0,,No one. That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:43.71,ENG,309,0,0,0,,PIease wait whiIe directions are downIoaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.47,0:37:51.93,ENG,310,0,0,0,,Proceed to the highlighted route.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.68,0:37:53.81,ENG,311,0,0,0,,Ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.52,0:37:56.73,ENG,312,0,0,0,,nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:37:59.56,ENG,313,0,0,0,,eight,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.23,0:38:02.48,ENG,314,0,0,0,,seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.86,0:38:05.03,ENG,315,0,0,0,,six...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.07,0:38:08.36,ENG,316,0,0,0,,- You sure you want to do this? - A lot has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:11.16,ENG,317,0,0,0,,...four... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.99,0:38:13.20,ENG,318,0,0,0,,...three,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.75,0:38:15.91,ENG,319,0,0,0,,two,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.42,0:38:18.58,ENG,320,0,0,0,,one,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.00,0:38:21.13,ENG,321,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.51,0:38:31.22,ENG,322,0,0,0,,Right turn ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.56,0:38:37.73,ENG,323,0,0,0,,You are now five miIes from your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.75,0:39:05.59,ENG,324,0,0,0,,How's my ass look, Chia Pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.42,0:39:07.96,ENG,325,0,0,0,,Ghetto Smurf.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.07,0:39:34.78,ENG,326,0,0,0,,Dead man driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:39.70,ENG,327,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.00,0:39:42.79,ENG,328,0,0,0,,Right turn ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.77,0:40:02.94,ENG,329,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.23,0:40:09.53,ENG,330,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.61,0:40:19.45,ENG,331,0,0,0,,Rerouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.09,0:40:30.26,ENG,332,0,0,0,,Proceed straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.55,0:40:35.93,ENG,333,0,0,0,,Rerouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.73,0:40:46.94,ENG,334,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:50.61,ENG,335,0,0,0,,- Rerouting. - Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.41,0:40:57.82,ENG,336,0,0,0,,You are 2.6 miIes from destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:02.41,ENG,337,0,0,0,,Oops, I didn't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.87,0:41:08.88,ENG,338,0,0,0,,You are now four and one-haIf miIes from your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.58,0:41:44.45,ENG,339,0,0,0,,- U-turn, if possible. - Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.54,0:41:48.58,ENG,340,0,0,0,,You are now 4.2 miIes from your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.42,0:41:51.84,ENG,341,0,0,0,,Sorry, car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.14,0:42:01.64,ENG,342,0,0,0,,You are now one miIe from your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.72,0:42:03.93,ENG,343,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess who's back, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.85,0:42:08.19,ENG,344,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.65,0:42:14.28,ENG,345,0,0,0,,Nice car, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:43:00.15,ENG,346,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.49,0:43:04.58,ENG,347,0,0,0,,You are now one-quarter mile from your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.22,0:43:24.85,ENG,348,0,0,0,,Too early, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.07,0:43:45.12,ENG,349,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.70,0:43:47.49,ENG,350,0,0,0,,Still a buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.91,0:43:54.04,ENG,351,0,0,0,,You have reached your destination. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.22,0:44:09.10,ENG,352,0,0,0,,At least we know you can't beat me straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.18,0:44:10.98,ENG,353,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were any rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.94,0:44:14.65,ENG,354,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call real driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.73,0:44:16.11,ENG,355,0,0,0,,No, that's bullshit, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.19,0:44:18.15,ENG,356,0,0,0,,Go cry to your mama, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:22.57,ENG,357,0,0,0,,You work for Braga now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.99,0:44:25.78,ENG,358,0,0,0,,When the GPS calls, you follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.79,0:44:32.58,ENG,359,0,0,0,,Driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.67,0:44:35.25,ENG,360,0,0,0,,What driver's license?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.79,0:44:37.34,ENG,361,0,0,0,,Thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.01,0:44:43.80,ENG,362,0,0,0,,Cell phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.89,0:44:51.10,ENG,363,0,0,0,,The print is for Campos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.77,0:44:53.64,ENG,364,0,0,0,,The number is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.11,0:44:58.48,ENG,365,0,0,0,,Yo, nutsack!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:45:02.15,ENG,366,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something, man, muscle beats import every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.24,0:45:05.03,ENG,367,0,0,0,,You know what I'm saying? Every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.91,0:45:08.95,ENG,368,0,0,0,,Ladies, let's get on back to Papa Dwight's.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.58,0:45:18.63,ENG,369,0,0,0,,Papa Dwight wants you to take off your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.29,0:45:22.26,ENG,370,0,0,0,,Dwight likes feet. Take off your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.17,0:45:24.72,ENG,371,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.84,0:45:28.85,ENG,372,0,0,0,,Dwight likes this foot a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:38.56,ENG,373,0,0,0,,Yes, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.73,0:45:41.94,ENG,374,0,0,0,,- Daddy Dwight loves... - FBI!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.82,0:45:46.86,ENG,375,0,0,0,,I didn't do nothing, man! Dwight didn't do nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.99,0:45:49.45,ENG,376,0,0,0,,- Hey, no! Stay, stay! Where you going? - Bye, Dwight!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.53,0:45:50.74,ENG,377,0,0,0,,No, what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.95,0:45:54.04,ENG,378,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for distribution of meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.12,0:45:57.46,ENG,379,0,0,0,,Meth? Dwight's never touched that shit, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.54,0:45:58.58,ENG,380,0,0,0,,Dwight has now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.67,0:46:01.04,ENG,381,0,0,0,,Yo, that ain't mine! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.13,0:46:03.25,ENG,382,0,0,0,,You know that's never gonna stick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.34,0:46:05.59,ENG,383,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.34,0:46:10.26,ENG,384,0,0,0,,Live it up! Live it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.73,0:47:07.24,ENG,385,0,0,0,,Yeah, Corona.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.24,0:47:11.61,ENG,386,0,0,0,,That's too bad about Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.70,0:47:15.16,ENG,387,0,0,0,,Having the Feds raid your house the same night you make the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:17.25,ENG,388,0,0,0,,So unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:20.75,ENG,389,0,0,0,,I wish I could say I was surprised to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.33,0:47:25.59,ENG,390,0,0,0,,What's to stop someone from telling them you're a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.67,0:47:29.42,ENG,391,0,0,0,,Probably the same thing that's keeping me from telling them why you're really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:31.72,ENG,392,0,0,0,,- What up, fellows? - Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.80,0:47:34.47,ENG,393,0,0,0,,- Great. You having a good time? - Yeah, a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.56,0:47:37.10,ENG,394,0,0,0,,Come on, let's have a better time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.64,0:47:41.19,ENG,395,0,0,0,,How's your car? It took a nasty bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.27,0:47:42.81,ENG,396,0,0,0,,lt'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.90,0:47:46.23,ENG,397,0,0,0,,I also heard you just got out of County.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.32,0:47:47.90,ENG,398,0,0,0,,Yeah. Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.99,ENG,399,0,0,0,,You know a guy named Jim Garcia?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:54.12,ENG,400,0,0,0,,Nah. Big place. Lots of names, lots of faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.62,0:47:58.66,ENG,401,0,0,0,,And you, you're wanted by a lot of people, homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.75,0:48:01.33,ENG,402,0,0,0,,Yeah, that kind of heat can't be good for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.42,0:48:04.33,ENG,403,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that depends on how you look at things.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.42,0:48:06.79,ENG,404,0,0,0,,I go down, I do time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.84,0:48:09.51,ENG,405,0,0,0,,I do real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:15.09,ENG,406,0,0,0,,I don't know about your other drivers, but when I see flashing lights in my mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.18,0:48:16.68,ENG,407,0,0,0,,I don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.06,0:48:24.06,ENG,408,0,0,0,,Do you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.15,0:48:30.32,ENG,409,0,0,0,,He used to date my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.40,0:48:32.74,ENG,410,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:37.70,ENG,411,0,0,0,,- You're a lucky man. - How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.74,0:48:40.75,ENG,412,0,0,0,,You're still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.79,0:48:50.84,ENG,413,0,0,0,,To the ladies we've loved and the ladies we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.56,0:49:01.60,ENG,414,0,0,0,,So, what's Braga about?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.52,0:49:05.39,ENG,415,0,0,0,,You know, he's just one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.48,0:49:08.94,ENG,416,0,0,0,,Came up from the streets. Down for el barrio.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.02,0:49:11.23,ENG,417,0,0,0,,Now he's a shot caller.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.07,0:49:13.95,ENG,418,0,0,0,,The boss of bosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.57,0:49:16.86,ENG,419,0,0,0,,See all these cats in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.45,0:49:20.12,ENG,420,0,0,0,,Any one of them would die for Braga.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.20,0:49:21.83,ENG,421,0,0,0,,lncluding you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.96,0:49:25.58,ENG,422,0,0,0,,Especially me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:37.13,ENG,423,0,0,0,,Enjoy the party, fellows. Club's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.22,0:49:40.47,ENG,424,0,0,0,,Whatever you want, booze, broads, it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.89,0:49:45.43,ENG,425,0,0,0,,Braga's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.02,0:49:51.40,ENG,426,0,0,0,,I'm taking the whole house down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.19,0:49:53.57,ENG,427,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.36,0:52:04.07,ENG,428,0,0,0,,Something interests you about this car?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:06.95,ENG,429,0,0,0,,Just admiring the body work.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.54,0:52:12.54,ENG,430,0,0,0,,Are you one of those boys who prefers cars to women?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.00,0:52:20.71,ENG,431,0,0,0,,I'm one of those boys that appreciates a fine body, regardless of the make.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.39,0:52:25.85,ENG,432,0,0,0,,Your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.89,0:52:31.56,ENG,433,0,0,0,,It's Fenix's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.77,0:52:36.86,ENG,434,0,0,0,,You'll meet him at the rendezvous. He'll be leading you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:39.73,ENG,435,0,0,0,,So now
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.15,0:52:43.53,ENG,436,0,0,0,,that I know your taste in cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.61,0:52:46.16,ENG,437,0,0,0,,tell me, what about your women?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.16,0:52:50.33,ENG,438,0,0,0,,It all starts with the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:58.00,ENG,439,0,0,0,,She's got to have those kind of eyes that can look right through the bullshit
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.09,0:53:00.21,ENG,440,0,0,0,,to the good in someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.84,0:53:08.01,ENG,441,0,0,0,,20% angel, 80% devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:11.52,ENG,442,0,0,0,,Down to earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.35,0:53:17.52,ENG,443,0,0,0,,Ain't afraid to get a little engine grease under her fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.49,0:53:27.11,ENG,444,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound anything like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.78,0:53:31.12,ENG,445,0,0,0,,It ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.21,0:53:40.21,ENG,446,0,0,0,,- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.30,0:53:43.38,ENG,447,0,0,0,,- I got a gift for you. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.47,0:53:46.01,ENG,448,0,0,0,,A dirty shot glass, just what I always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.09,0:53:47.68,ENG,449,0,0,0,,I got these from the club last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.76,0:53:49.72,ENG,450,0,0,0,,There's two sets of prints here. Run them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.80,0:53:53.31,ENG,451,0,0,0,,I know one of these is Campos'. I think the other might be Braga's.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.39,0:53:55.94,ENG,452,0,0,0,,And you're gonna have to go beyond lnterpol.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.02,0:53:58.40,ENG,453,0,0,0,,So, that means I have to contact individual agencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:54:01.02,ENG,454,0,0,0,,and that could take weeks. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.12,0:54:17.08,ENG,455,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.17,0:54:20.33,ENG,456,0,0,0,,That's your third traffic violation in less than three blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.42,0:54:22.42,ENG,457,0,0,0,,Slow it down, O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.09,0:54:24.80,ENG,458,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.87,0:54:54.95,ENG,459,0,0,0,,He stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.59,0:55:51.01,ENG,460,0,0,0,,We lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.09,0:55:52.59,ENG,461,0,0,0,,He killed the tracker. We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:54.93,ENG,462,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, he killed the tracker. We don't know that yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.01,0:55:56.93,ENG,463,0,0,0,,Get the bird overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.06,0:56:01.10,ENG,464,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm moving north, 33', 56'...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.11,0:56:06.48,ENG,465,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.42,0:56:31.72,ENG,466,0,0,0,,Base, fIag nine, I'm at AngeIs 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.80,0:56:35.43,ENG,467,0,0,0,,I don't have a taIIy on the target. Repeat, I don't have a taIIy on the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.51,0:56:37.22,ENG,468,0,0,0,,They're gone, there's no one down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.31,0:56:38.64,ENG,469,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.69,0:56:54.49,ENG,470,0,0,0,,This ain't right, bro. Nobody said nothing about being locked in no truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.57,0:56:56.32,ENG,471,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:00.83,ENG,472,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.54,0:57:05.58,ENG,473,0,0,0,,Yo! Where do you think they're taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.67,0:57:07.25,ENG,474,0,0,0,,Don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.17,0:57:13.01,ENG,475,0,0,0,,We're all just along for the ride now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.10,0:57:26.10,ENG,476,0,0,0,,Welcome to Mexico, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.86,0:57:34.24,ENG,477,0,0,0,,There are helicopters and surveillance cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.32,0:57:36.78,ENG,478,0,0,0,,that scan for heat signatures at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.87,0:57:40.83,ENG,479,0,0,0,,But there are blind spots that I can guide you through via satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.91,0:57:45.41,ENG,480,0,0,0,,There can be no margin of error, so you must follow my every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.12,0:57:47.50,ENG,481,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.54,0:57:52.09,ENG,482,0,0,0,,I thought Fenix was gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.26,0:57:57.34,ENG,483,0,0,0,,He'll meet you out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.22,0:58:04.56,ENG,484,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, sync up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.35,0:58:09.23,ENG,485,0,0,0,,Good luck, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.66,0:58:24.24,ENG,486,0,0,0,,SateIIite Iinkup engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.58,0:58:28.62,ENG,487,0,0,0,,Keep proceeding northbound at current speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.59,0:58:34.46,ENG,488,0,0,0,,Stay cIose to Fenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.63,0:58:37.09,ENG,489,0,0,0,,He'II Iead you across.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.27,0:58:54.82,ENG,490,0,0,0,,I got a heat signature northbound along Legardo Ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:59:01.82,ENG,491,0,0,0,,Thermal imaging window on the Mexico side's gonna be down for about 45 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.91,0:59:03.78,ENG,492,0,0,0,,Get the camera on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.87,0:59:07.70,ENG,493,0,0,0,,Manual override. Rerouting camera to designated coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.88,0:59:13.67,ENG,494,0,0,0,,Hurry it up. You guys have been tagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.47,0:59:24.81,ENG,495,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:28.39,ENG,496,0,0,0,,Toretto, get back in formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.56,0:59:32.65,ENG,497,0,0,0,,Reimaging commencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.45,0:59:43.37,ENG,498,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.45,0:59:44.66,ENG,499,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.70,0:59:48.66,ENG,500,0,0,0,,Get the helicopters to cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.75,0:59:55.88,ENG,501,0,0,0,,Base, we're 40 seconds out from Legardo Ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.75,0:59:58.38,ENG,502,0,0,0,,They're sending a heIicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:01.88,ENG,503,0,0,0,,You have 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.69,1:00:13.81,ENG,504,0,0,0,,North 32' 33', west 116' 49'.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.32,1:00:22.11,ENG,505,0,0,0,,The window is cIosing fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.20,1:00:25.37,ENG,506,0,0,0,,You need to get out of there before they send ground support.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.58,1:00:33.25,ENG,507,0,0,0,,Fifteen seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.71,1:00:41.05,ENG,508,0,0,0,,Base, target is at two miIes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.23,1:00:56.44,ENG,509,0,0,0,,You're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.48,1:01:01.57,ENG,510,0,0,0,,You need to get out now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.54,1:01:17.54,ENG,511,0,0,0,,Base, we're at north 32' 33', west 116' 49'.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.63,1:01:21.51,ENG,512,0,0,0,,We have no visuaI contact. RoII ground units for confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:43.78,ENG,513,0,0,0,,Sloppy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.45,1:01:45.99,ENG,514,0,0,0,,Very sloppy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.62,1:01:53.66,ENG,515,0,0,0,,What are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.17,1:01:57.50,ENG,516,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.63,1:02:01.96,ENG,517,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:06.68,ENG,518,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.76,1:02:08.72,ENG,519,0,0,0,,Come on, today, man. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.80,1:02:10.68,ENG,520,0,0,0,,Hey, don't touch me. Hey, don't touch me, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.06,1:02:13.77,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Hey, I said don't touch me, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.85,1:02:15.39,ENG,522,0,0,0,,Hey, look, dawg, don't put your hands on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.48,1:02:16.98,ENG,523,0,0,0,,Hey, Malik, chill, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.10,1:02:18.31,ENG,524,0,0,0,,Yo, man, what's up with your boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.40,1:02:20.27,ENG,525,0,0,0,,Hey, boss man!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.19,1:02:24.90,ENG,526,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.99,1:02:28.74,ENG,527,0,0,0,,I said only pussies run nitrometh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.37,1:02:33.45,ENG,528,0,0,0,,You looked under my hood?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.33,1:02:42.04,ENG,529,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.13,1:02:44.34,ENG,530,0,0,0,,Got something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.17,1:02:46.51,ENG,531,0,0,0,,'70 Plymouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.51,1:02:50.80,ENG,532,0,0,0,,Her name was Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.31,ENG,534,0,0,0,,Where's my money?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.02,1:03:02.36,ENG,535,0,0,0,,And somebody wrecked her car.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.16,1:03:11.41,ENG,536,0,0,0,,I wrecked her car.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.00,1:03:17.04,ENG,537,0,0,0,,You remember her face?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.79,1:03:23.79,ENG,538,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.67,1:03:26.30,ENG,539,0,0,0,,'Cause I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.67,1:03:30.34,ENG,540,0,0,0,,Last time I saw it, it was burning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.15,1:03:45.52,ENG,541,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.15,1:03:49.90,ENG,542,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.98,1:04:25.48,ENG,543,0,0,0,,Dom, get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.77,1:04:28.44,ENG,544,0,0,0,,Get in! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.44,1:04:34.28,ENG,545,0,0,0,,Come on! Get in the fucking car! Let's go! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.27,1:05:02.89,ENG,546,0,0,0,,What have you got, Trinh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.98,1:05:05.56,ENG,547,0,0,0,,We're contacting agencies in multiple countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.65,1:05:10.65,ENG,548,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, most of them have to manually scan their prints for us to upload.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.49,1:05:13.57,ENG,549,0,0,0,,O'Conner's on line five.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:15.74,ENG,550,0,0,0,,And, sir, you should see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.82,1:05:17.32,ENG,551,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.71,1:05:28.84,ENG,552,0,0,0,,Talk to me, O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.30,1:05:31.46,ENG,553,0,0,0,,- Where the hell have you been? - I got the shipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.55,1:05:34.55,ENG,554,0,0,0,,"I got the shipment", or  "we got the shipment"?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.63,1:05:36.68,ENG,555,0,0,0,,What are you taIking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.76,1:05:41.22,ENG,556,0,0,0,,Traffic cams in the area picked up pictures of you and Toretto together.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.35,1:05:47.10,ENG,557,0,0,0,,Listen to me, O'Conner. Bring in the shipment and bring in Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.52,1:05:50.19,ENG,558,0,0,0,,But I thought the point was to get Braga. We got an opportunity here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.27,1:05:52.86,ENG,559,0,0,0,,Brian, the clock stopped ticking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.74,1:05:56.03,ENG,560,0,0,0,,Bring them in. Are we cIear?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.37,1:06:01.70,ENG,561,0,0,0,,O'Conner?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.71,1:06:14.55,ENG,562,0,0,0,,So this is what $60 million looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.30,1:06:18.93,ENG,563,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got to get you to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.01,1:06:21.68,ENG,564,0,0,0,,We got to find a place to hide this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.27,1:06:25.43,ENG,565,0,0,0,,I got a spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.53,1:06:38.45,ENG,566,0,0,0,,502, wet reckless. I need a 48-hour hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.57,1:06:42.41,ENG,567,0,0,0,,Out back. Any spot you can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.58,1:06:49.46,ENG,568,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.42,1:06:56.59,ENG,569,0,0,0,,Yeah. The last place they'll check, their own impound yard. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.10,1:07:04.97,ENG,570,0,0,0,,You know, I've been thinking,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.06,1:07:07.52,ENG,571,0,0,0,,when you blew up your car back there, you blew up mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.60,1:07:10.10,ENG,572,0,0,0,,- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.19,1:07:12.77,ENG,573,0,0,0,,So now you owe me a 10-second car.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.11,1:07:16.36,ENG,574,0,0,0,,- Is that right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.62,1:07:29.33,ENG,575,0,0,0,,Now we're even.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.01,1:07:47.89,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Is this your way of keeping me away from him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.02,1:07:51.85,ENG,577,0,0,0,,- You're the only one I could call. - He's my brother, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.49,1:08:01.57,ENG,578,0,0,0,,The bullet's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.12,1:08:13.08,ENG,579,0,0,0,,I'm gonna clean it and stitch it up. It's going to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.17,1:08:15.63,ENG,580,0,0,0,,I bet you're going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.30,1:08:17.63,ENG,581,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.59,1:08:23.01,ENG,582,0,0,0,,- Want some of this? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.09,1:08:25.14,ENG,583,0,0,0,,It's spicy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.89,1:08:28.52,ENG,584,0,0,0,,I like it hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.64,1:08:31.85,ENG,585,0,0,0,,Dom, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.94,1:08:34.85,ENG,586,0,0,0,,You reached first, you have to say grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:49.04,ENG,587,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord, for blessing this table.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.50,1:08:55.25,ENG,588,0,0,0,,With food, family and friendship.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.99,1:09:31.33,ENG,589,0,0,0,,You asked me why I let Dom go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.41,1:09:36.08,ENG,590,0,0,0,,I think it's because at that moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.79,1:09:40.63,ENG,591,0,0,0,,I respected him more than I did myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.01,1:09:46.22,ENG,592,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:52.93,ENG,593,0,0,0,,One thing I learned from Dom is that nothing really matters unless you have a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.15,1:09:58.44,ENG,594,0,0,0,,And what's your code, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.82,1:10:02.61,ENG,595,0,0,0,,I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:39.02,ENG,596,0,0,0,,Shit. Hey, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:41.69,ENG,597,0,0,0,,- When were you gonna tell me? - Dom, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.77,1:10:43.73,ENG,598,0,0,0,,When were you gonna tell me you were running Letty?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.82,1:10:46.15,ENG,599,0,0,0,,- Let me explain... - When were you gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:52.87,ENG,600,0,0,0,,Dom, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.95,1:10:55.12,ENG,601,0,0,0,,- You don't understand. - I don't understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.20,1:10:56.41,ENG,602,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.58,1:11:01.79,ENG,603,0,0,0,,She did it for...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.88,1:11:06.42,ENG,604,0,0,0,,Dom, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.51,1:11:08.63,ENG,605,0,0,0,,Dom, stop it! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.06,1:11:21.69,ENG,606,0,0,0,,She did it for you, Dom! She did it for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.19,1:11:30.53,ENG,607,0,0,0,,Letty came to me to clear your name in exchange for bringing down Braga.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.58,1:11:36.08,ENG,608,0,0,0,,She just wanted you to come home!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.26,1:11:55.05,ENG,609,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.14,1:11:56.56,ENG,610,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.42,1:12:27.25,ENG,611,0,0,0,, You better have one hell of an explanation. You disobeyed a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.13,1:12:30.13,ENG,612,0,0,0,,- Where's the shipment? - It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.22,1:12:32.01,ENG,613,0,0,0,,It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.09,1:12:34.97,ENG,614,0,0,0,,Look, we could use the shipment to parade in front of the media,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.05,1:12:36.97,ENG,615,0,0,0,,get a few hundred pounds of heroin off the street,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.06,1:12:40.77,ENG,616,0,0,0,,but Braga's just gonna send another shipment next week and the week after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.85,1:12:42.98,ENG,617,0,0,0,,Let's use the shipment to lure Braga out
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.06,1:12:45.10,ENG,618,0,0,0,,and lop the head off a multi-billion dollar cartel.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.19,1:12:47.57,ENG,619,0,0,0,,And how do you suggest we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.65,1:12:49.61,ENG,620,0,0,0,,A hand-to-hand exchange with Braga.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.69,1:12:51.07,ENG,621,0,0,0,,He'll never show.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.15,1:12:52.95,ENG,622,0,0,0,,He can't afford not to.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.08,1:13:04.75,ENG,623,0,0,0,,You got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.25,1:13:07.92,ENG,624,0,0,0,,There's a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.80,1:13:13.59,ENG,625,0,0,0,,We bag Braga, you let Toretto walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.39,1:13:24.60,ENG,626,0,0,0,,- Yes? - It's Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.65,1:13:27.94,ENG,627,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.32,1:13:32.24,ENG,628,0,0,0,,You know, when I gave you my number, I was hoping you'd call.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.82,1:13:35.36,ENG,629,0,0,0,,But not under these circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.70,1:13:38.83,ENG,630,0,0,0,,What circumstances? Me being alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.87,1:13:41.83,ENG,631,0,0,0,,Don't take it personaIIy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.33,1:13:44.25,ENG,632,0,0,0,,It's just business.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.33,1:13:45.92,ENG,633,0,0,0,,I got some business of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.21,1:13:48.67,ENG,634,0,0,0,,Get Campos.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.17,1:13:52.59,ENG,635,0,0,0,,It's them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.93,1:13:57.93,ENG,636,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.18,1:14:02.18,ENG,637,0,0,0,,Was that how Braga inspires loyalty? Killing his drivers?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:05.02,ENG,638,0,0,0,,One can always find more drivers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:07.27,ENG,639,0,0,0,,It's just good business.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.52,1:14:08.77,ENG,640,0,0,0,,I want to trade.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.06,1:14:11.11,ENG,641,0,0,0,,Braga doesn't negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.19,1:14:12.19,ENG,642,0,0,0,, Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.28,1:14:17.16,ENG,643,0,0,0,,You explain to him how all of a sudden $60 million worth of product disappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.87,1:14:20.16,ENG,644,0,0,0,,I know that can't be good for business.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.24,1:14:22.79,ENG,645,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.29,1:14:27.54,ENG,646,0,0,0,,Six million cash, delivered by Braga himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.21,1:14:31.84,ENG,647,0,0,0,,I don't Iike being shot at.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.21,1:14:35.47,ENG,648,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna put my neck out again unless he's got something to lose, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.55,1:14:37.13,ENG,649,0,0,0,,He'll never go for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.22,1:14:40.85,ENG,650,0,0,0,,Either I deal with Braga, or you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.85,1:14:46.39,ENG,651,0,0,0,,When and where?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.45,1:15:05.37,ENG,652,0,0,0,,Sir, players are onsite. Holding positions at the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.83,1:15:08.41,ENG,653,0,0,0,,All right. Listen up. Everybody stay frosty.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.50,1:15:11.17,ENG,654,0,0,0,,We don't move a muscIe untiI O'Conner gives the signaI.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.25,1:15:13.96,ENG,655,0,0,0,,When he gets the money, you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.55,1:15:17.01,ENG,656,0,0,0,,Well, the good news is, when we get this guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:19.51,ENG,657,0,0,0,,you walk out of here a free man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.89,1:15:21.30,ENG,658,0,0,0,,Is that what they told you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.39,1:15:23.01,ENG,659,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.10,1:15:26.52,ENG,660,0,0,0,,You still put milk and cookies out for Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.81,1:15:28.98,ENG,661,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.77,1:15:34.86,ENG,662,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.94,1:15:37.03,ENG,663,0,0,0,,ln case things go shitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.99,1:15:44.03,ENG,664,0,0,0,,Just like old times?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.12,1:15:45.41,ENG,665,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:50.29,ENG,666,0,0,0,,You dropped something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.37,1:15:52.54,ENG,667,0,0,0,,- That's what you wanted, - right? Dom...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.64,1:16:10.27,ENG,668,0,0,0,,He's harmless. Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.02,1:16:14.52,ENG,669,0,0,0,,And he's really sorry about Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.65,1:16:18.44,ENG,670,0,0,0,,Where's our stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.20,1:16:24.49,ENG,671,0,0,0,,You mean the stuff that used to be in here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.66,1:16:29.45,ENG,672,0,0,0,,Well, you'll see it when we see Braga. That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.41,1:16:31.83,ENG,673,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.21,1:16:34.21,ENG,674,0,0,0,,Braga keeps his word.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.21,1:17:19.71,ENG,675,0,0,0,,$2 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.80,1:17:23.55,ENG,676,0,0,0,,You get the rest when I get my property.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.89,1:17:29.51,ENG,677,0,0,0,,- Stasiak. - We got a match.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.60,1:17:31.64,ENG,678,0,0,0,,The fingerprint's Braga's 100%.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.73,1:17:34.19,ENG,679,0,0,0,,Just waiting on faciaI confirmation via fax.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.27,1:17:36.23,ENG,680,0,0,0,,I got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.31,1:17:40.07,ENG,681,0,0,0,,You wearing pink when you were clawing your way out of el barrio?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.32,1:17:42.78,ENG,682,0,0,0,,Order all agents to move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.86,1:17:45.99,ENG,683,0,0,0,,We got confirmation. Primary suspect wearing gray suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.07,1:17:47.07,ENG,684,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.16,1:17:49.08,ENG,685,0,0,0,,Sir, O'Conner hasn't given us the signal yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:52.50,ENG,686,0,0,0,,What part of that didn't you understand? We just got confirmation. Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.58,1:17:55.92,ENG,687,0,0,0,,Secure primary suspect in gray suit. Repeat!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:58.58,ENG,688,0,0,0,,Secure primary suspect in gray suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.06,1:18:14.77,ENG,689,0,0,0,,You're thinking what I'm thinking, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.56,1:18:19.19,ENG,690,0,0,0,,He ain't Braga.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.78,1:18:24.78,ENG,691,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.95,1:18:27.20,ENG,692,0,0,0,,Drop your weapons! FBl!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.61,1:18:28.91,ENG,693,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.41,1:18:34.12,ENG,694,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.21,1:18:40.08,ENG,695,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.38,1:18:45.97,ENG,696,0,0,0,,Run him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.47,1:18:47.68,ENG,697,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:50.01,ENG,698,0,0,0,,Campos is Braga!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.48,1:18:58.77,ENG,699,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.15,1:19:08.28,ENG,700,0,0,0,,Approaching primary target.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.82,1:19:10.99,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Primary suspect is secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.66,1:19:15.45,ENG,702,0,0,0,,He was under your nose the whoIe time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.00,1:19:17.75,ENG,703,0,0,0,,Now Braga's escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.83,1:19:20.79,ENG,704,0,0,0,,Toretto's heading south, probably long across the border by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.88,1:19:23.09,ENG,705,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea the kind of trouble you're in, O'Conner?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.17,1:19:25.13,ENG,706,0,0,0,,I was doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.21,1:19:27.76,ENG,707,0,0,0,,He ain't the first bad guy you helped escape the law's grasp.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:29.80,ENG,708,0,0,0,,As of now, you're being taken off active duty,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.89,1:19:32.85,ENG,709,0,0,0,,until this house can mount a formal inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.02,1:19:36.77,ENG,710,0,0,0,,What about Braga?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.85,1:19:40.19,ENG,711,0,0,0,,That's no longer your concern.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:52.07,ENG,712,0,0,0,,We now know where Braga is, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.16,1:19:55.62,ENG,713,0,0,0,,Customs tracked him via satellite to his home base in Tecali, Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.70,1:19:58.12,ENG,714,0,0,0,,Mexico is out of our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.92,1:20:02.50,ENG,715,0,0,0,,The fact is
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.58,1:20:06.67,ENG,716,0,0,0,,the brass will be so busy holding press conferences over the seizure,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.76,1:20:08.88,ENG,717,0,0,0,,we'll skate under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.34,1:20:12.38,ENG,718,0,0,0,,I thought we signed on to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.76,1:20:52.88,ENG,719,0,0,0,,Everyone's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.26,1:20:54.89,ENG,720,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.18,1:20:57.51,ENG,721,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you've gone with the times
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.60,1:21:01.18,ENG,722,0,0,0,,and switched to electronic fuel injection. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.31,1:21:04.40,ENG,723,0,0,0,,Buster became a gearhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.48,1:21:10.28,ENG,724,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.20,1:21:16.87,ENG,725,0,0,0,,I don't plan on bringing anyone back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.83,1:21:20.16,ENG,726,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.92,1:21:30.59,ENG,727,0,0,0,,Hit that throttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.87,1:21:57.99,ENG,728,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.78,1:22:42.79,ENG,729,0,0,0,,How do you say goodbye to your only brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.96,1:22:46.37,ENG,730,0,0,0,,You don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.28,1:23:57.65,ENG,731,0,0,0,,I thought you weren't gonna show up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.74,1:23:59.36,ENG,732,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.24,1:24:02.70,ENG,733,0,0,0,,I'm willing to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.58,1:24:09.08,ENG,734,0,0,0,,This will help get you to Braga.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.29,1:24:14.38,ENG,735,0,0,0,,Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.38,1:24:18.01,ENG,736,0,0,0,,Going in there is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.56,1:24:28.31,ENG,737,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.90,1:24:34.35,ENG,738,0,0,0,,You must have loved her very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.42,1:24:55.13,ENG,739,0,0,0,,So this is where my jurisdiction ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.92,1:25:03.09,ENG,740,0,0,0,,And this is where mine begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.02,1:26:06.07,ENG,741,0,0,0,,- welcome to the house of the lord, Sr.Braga. - Don't worry father, everthing's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.17,1:26:14.67,ENG,742,0,0,0,,To help us get to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.43,1:26:30.97,ENG,743,0,0,0,,Please receive this blessing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.47,1:27:15.35,ENG,744,0,0,0,,You ain't forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.81,1:27:20.98,ENG,745,0,0,0,,You boys want to arrest me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.06,1:27:23.94,ENG,746,0,0,0,,...in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.03,1:27:26.07,ENG,747,0,0,0,,No, we're beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.15,1:27:29.95,ENG,748,0,0,0,,You can't buy your way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.32,1:27:32.99,ENG,749,0,0,0,,You and me...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.20,1:27:37.04,ENG,750,0,0,0,,You and me, we're not so different.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.79,1:27:40.37,ENG,751,0,0,0,,You're no hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.01,1:27:52.68,ENG,752,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.81,1:27:59.14,ENG,753,0,0,0,,And that's why you're going back across the border.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.15,1:28:06.86,ENG,754,0,0,0,,But Fenix is mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.86,1:28:08.94,ENG,755,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.22,1:28:32.34,ENG,756,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.39,1:28:40.93,ENG,757,0,0,0,,You'll make it a couple of miles out, if you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.49,1:29:35.74,ENG,758,0,0,0,,You know where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.78,1:29:38.95,ENG,759,0,0,0,,You want to borrow my GPS?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.66,1:29:44.37,ENG,760,0,0,0,,Where are your boys at?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.46,1:29:46.00,ENG,761,0,0,0,,Are they going to show up or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.46,1:29:51.51,ENG,762,0,0,0,,Careful what you ask for.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.81,1:30:10.02,ENG,763,0,0,0,,Just stop. Just stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.58,1:30:24.83,ENG,764,0,0,0,,Don't shoot the boss, idiots.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.21,1:30:31.92,ENG,765,0,0,0,,Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.77,1:30:49.86,ENG,766,0,0,0,,Dom, head to the tunnel. Let's use the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.09,1:31:19.05,ENG,767,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.81,1:31:30.31,ENG,768,0,0,0,,You sure you know where the tunnels are? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.86,1:31:32.61,ENG,769,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'd hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.69,1:31:37.36,ENG,770,0,0,0,,This might hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.75,1:31:52.92,ENG,771,0,0,0,,You're in my world now, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.53,1:32:24.07,ENG,772,0,0,0,,That's it, baby! End of the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.16,1:32:25.62,ENG,773,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.41,1:32:27.49,ENG,774,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.58,1:32:29.12,ENG,775,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.73,1:33:00.15,ENG,776,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.36,1:34:20.44,ENG,777,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.57,1:34:23.40,ENG,778,0,0,0,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.53,1:35:54.95,ENG,779,0,0,0,,Pussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:13.97,ENG,780,0,0,0,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.52,1:36:18.89,ENG,781,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just keep pressure there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.56,1:36:21.56,ENG,782,0,0,0,,You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.44,1:36:29.53,ENG,783,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.16,1:36:34.16,ENG,784,0,0,0,,I ain't running anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.79,1:36:41.87,ENG,785,0,0,0,,I gotta ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.54,1:36:43.67,ENG,786,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.42,1:36:48.46,ENG,787,0,0,0,,You know I would have won that race if you didn't cheat, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.55,1:36:53.47,ENG,788,0,0,0,,You hit your head hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.35,1:37:00.23,ENG,789,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.90,1:37:12.28,ENG,790,0,0,0,,All rise.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.58,1:37:19.29,ENG,791,0,0,0,,Please be seated.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.54,1:37:25.58,ENG,792,0,0,0,,Please rise, Mr. Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.96,1:37:30.26,ENG,793,0,0,0,,I've listened to the testimony
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:32.88,ENG,794,0,0,0,,and taken into special consideration
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.97,1:37:36.97,ENG,795,0,0,0,,Agent O'Conner's appeal of clemency on behalf of Mr. Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.93,1:37:40.60,ENG,796,0,0,0,,That his actions directly resulted in the apprehension
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.68,1:37:43.52,ENG,797,0,0,0,,of known drug trafficker Arturo Braga.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.06,1:37:46.44,ENG,798,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.73,1:37:49.69,ENG,799,0,0,0,,this judiciary finds that
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.78,1:37:54.61,ENG,800,0,0,0,,one right does not make up for a lifetime worth of wrongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.28,1:37:57.03,ENG,801,0,0,0,,And as such,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.12,1:38:02.12,ENG,802,0,0,0,,I find that I am forced to level the maximum sentence under California law.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.54,1:38:06.21,ENG,803,0,0,0,,Dominic Toretto,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.04,1:38:11.05,ENG,804,0,0,0,,you are hereby sentenced to serve 25 years to life
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.13,1:38:14.22,ENG,805,0,0,0,,at the Lompoc maximum security prison system
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.97,1:38:17.76,ENG,806,0,0,0,,without the possibiIity of earIy paroIe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.35,1:38:20.18,ENG,807,0,0,0,,This court is adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.18,1:39:31.18,ENG,808,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:46.13,CHS,2,0,0,0,,多米尼加共和国
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:59.39,CHS,3,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.51,0:01:02.31,CHS,4,0,0,0,,- 好了吗？ - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.81,CHS,5,0,0,0,,大赚一笔吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.19,CHS,6,0,0,0,,各就各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:16.86,CHS,7,0,0,0,,我还以为我们要抢银行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:19.32,CHS,8,0,0,0,,而不是在这前不着村后不着店 的地方抢油罐车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:22.08,CHS,9,0,0,0,,在这 石油就是黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:25.24,CHS,10,0,0,0,,是啊 可是银行不会乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:29.88,CHS,11,0,0,0,,每次你靠近银行 我们都要把你从牢里弄出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:32.84,CHS,12,0,0,0,,别聊了 开始干活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:35.26,CHS,13,0,0,0,,我可不想惹恼他 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:52.40,CHS,14,0,0,0,,听到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.55,CHS,15,0,0,0,,贪吃的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.15,CHS,16,0,0,0,,我们要麻利点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.07,CHS,17,0,0,0,,还有4公里就下坡了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.01,CHS,18,0,0,0,,接好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.92,CHS,19,0,0,0,,都是你的 韩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:59.01,CHS,20,0,0,0,,液体黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:07.35,CHS,21,0,0,0,,我们搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.60,CHS,22,0,0,0,,提戈 该你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:15.69,CHS,23,0,0,0,,看看你6次以内能否搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:18.82,CHS,24,0,0,0,,说什么呢 这回一次搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.03,CHS,25,0,0,0,,三次差不多 好啦 提戈 动真格的了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:42.22,CHS,26,0,0,0,,还剩1公里 前面没路了 动作快点 老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:44.13,CHS,27,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:54.60,CHS,28,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:02.69,CHS,29,0,0,0,,提戈 快松开！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.84,CHS,30,0,0,0,,- 别犯傻 松开挂钩！ - 你以为我在干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:28.35,CHS,31,0,0,0,,笨蛋 快松开！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:51.95,CHS,32,0,0,0,,- 喷那个挂钩！ - 我没有锤子！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.54,CHS,33,0,0,0,,做吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.55,CHS,34,0,0,0,,抓紧！抓紧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.14,CHS,35,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.52,CHS,36,0,0,0,,抓紧点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.67,CHS,37,0,0,0,,莱蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:43.00,CHS,38,0,0,0,,- 抓住我的手！ - 我够不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.76,CHS,39,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.16,CHS,40,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.16,CHS,41,0,0,0,,莱蒂 跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:21.29,CHS,42,0,0,0,,我接着你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:55.70,CHS,43,0,0,0,,多姆…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:06:59.25,CHS,44,0,0,0,,多姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.50,CHS,45,0,0,0,,多姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:41.50,CHS,46,0,0,0,,《速度与激情4》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:08.78,CHS,47,0,0,0,,普莱莫在机场当保安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:12.20,CHS,48,0,0,0,,他说要来几架运油机
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.87,CHS,49,0,0,0,,你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.12,CHS,50,0,0,0,,钱！钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.62,CHS,51,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:27.17,CHS,52,0,0,0,,为什么你那一叠总比我的厚？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:29.09,CHS,53,0,0,0,,我是大号的 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.26,CHS,54,0,0,0,,找点乐子去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:41.72,CHS,55,0,0,0,,警察突击了我们在巴拉科阿的修车厂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:45.06,CHS,56,0,0,0,,他们要抓的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:50.40,CHS,57,0,0,0,,我们刚刚又给他们留下了线索
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:53.57,CHS,58,0,0,0,,我们明早就离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:56.99,CHS,59,0,0,0,,不 他们要抓的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.57,CHS,60,0,0,0,,如果他们抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:02.66,CHS,61,0,0,0,,他们会把与我有牵连的人都投入大牢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:07.79,CHS,62,0,0,0,,韩 我们做得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.55,CHS,63,0,0,0,,你该去做些自己的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:19.47,CHS,64,0,0,0,,听说他们在东京很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.69,CHS,65,0,0,0,,见到莱蒂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.08,CHS,66,0,0,0,,她在那
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.79,CHS,67,0,0,0,,我听说里约每年这时候很美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.72,CHS,68,0,0,0,,警察追得越来越紧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:59.22,CHS,69,0,0,0,,这就是我们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:05.93,CHS,70,0,0,0,,我是个移动的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:09.81,CHS,71,0,0,0,,我不想被抓住的时候让你受牵连
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:14.40,CHS,72,0,0,0,,“不开车就去死” 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.53,CHS,73,0,0,0,,多姆 我们干这行多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:24.37,CHS,74,0,0,0,,突然之间 凭空就说这很危险了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.54,CHS,75,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.63,CHS,76,0,0,0,,我们能化险为夷的 一向如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.62,CHS,77,0,0,0,,洛杉矶市区
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:02.84,CHS,78,0,0,0,,- 我什么都不知道！ - 告诉我他的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.00,CHS,79,0,0,0,,- 我什么都不知道！ - 告诉我他的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:08.09,CHS,80,0,0,0,,大卫·帕克！他就是你要找的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:09.80,CHS,81,0,0,0,,别开枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.81,CHS,82,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 听着 他没发火因为昨天他偷懒没锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.86,CHS,83,0,0,0,,今天 有人拿来了甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.15,CHS,84,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.07,CHS,85,0,0,0,,对不起来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:32.70,CHS,86,0,0,0,,你在市区闹运之后就投诉不断
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:35.95,CHS,87,0,0,0,,告诉我给你复职不是错误
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:39.21,CHS,88,0,0,0,,- 我拿到个名字 大卫·帕克 - 就这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:41.75,CHS,89,0,0,0,,就听到个大卫·帕克？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:44.71,CHS,90,0,0,0,,从这窗户扔出去块点心 能砸到50个大卫·帕克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.46,CHS,91,0,0,0,,- 是韩国人 不是中国人 - 随便
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:52.72,CHS,92,0,0,0,,帕克召集街头车手给布拉加运货
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:55.39,CHS,93,0,0,0,,我们找到帕克 就能将他们一网打尽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:04.09,CHS,94,0,0,0,,巴拿马 巴拿马城
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.71,CHS,95,0,0,0,,多姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:24.46,CHS,96,0,0,0,,米娅 我说过不要打到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.67,CHS,97,0,0,0,,多姆 是莱蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.46,CHS,98,0,0,0,,遇害了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:49.61,CHS,99,0,0,0,,我们到这里作最后致意…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:52.86,CHS,100,0,0,0,,我们来追忆她的旅程…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:16:01.33,CHS,101,0,0,0,,“上帝是我的牧师 我本不需要 他使我接受…”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:23.98,CHS,102,0,0,0,,面部识别程序在特伦托
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.90,CHS,103,0,0,0,,入境10分钟后发现了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.48,CHS,104,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.57,CHS,105,0,0,0,,我以为他会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:30.08,CHS,106,0,0,0,,我告诉你不要来的 他们在监视这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:32.63,CHS,107,0,0,0,,- 如果他们发现你… - 不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:38.63,CHS,108,0,0,0,,好啦 瞧瞧你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:07.37,CHS,109,0,0,0,,莱蒂不让他们处理掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.54,CHS,110,0,0,0,,即便它是个诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:17.30,CHS,111,0,0,0,,她回来以后 就到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.84,CHS,112,0,0,0,,夜以继日地改进它
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:28.10,CHS,113,0,0,0,,真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.69,CHS,114,0,0,0,,就好像她知道你会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:37.07,CHS,115,0,0,0,,我要看看出事现场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:46.16,CHS,116,0,0,0,,我刚和副局长通过电话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:50.29,CHS,117,0,0,0,,如果我们72小时内在布拉加的案子上还没进展
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.63,CHS,118,0,0,0,,我们就都下岗了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:56.34,CHS,119,0,0,0,,我知道是新来的 但是为什么那么急？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:58.21,CHS,120,0,0,0,,因为已经两年了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.80,CHS,121,0,0,0,,我们派去卧底的三个探员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.26,CHS,122,0,0,0,,都裹着尸袋回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:07.93,CHS,123,0,0,0,,他运入境的海洛因比埃斯科巴10年的都多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.81,CHS,124,0,0,0,,这家伙成为国家安全最大的威胁之一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.98,CHS,125,0,0,0,,我们连他的照片都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:16.57,CHS,126,0,0,0,,没有指纹！连出生日期都不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.82,CHS,127,0,0,0,,大卫·帕克是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:24.12,CHS,128,0,0,0,,他是我们潜入布拉加组织的通行证？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:27.99,CHS,129,0,0,0,,我们通过数据库搜索 按可能性排序
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.00,CHS,130,0,0,0,,已经有500个了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:33.12,CHS,131,0,0,0,,帕克不重要 对我来说就是个小混混
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:37.17,CHS,132,0,0,0,,不是的 没有帕克介绍 布拉加不会让车手给他送货
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:40.01,CHS,133,0,0,0,,监视交通 非法改装
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:44.43,CHS,134,0,0,0,,街头赛车 这家伙肯定有记录 我们会抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:46.72,CHS,135,0,0,0,,最好如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:49.06,CHS,136,0,0,0,,知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:52.81,CHS,137,0,0,0,,你那小子特伦托的红色雪佛兰 在他家附近出现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.69,CHS,138,0,0,0,,我要把他抓来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:57.02,CHS,139,0,0,0,,你抓不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:07.66,CHS,140,0,0,0,,就在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:15.75,CHS,141,0,0,0,,你在那发现了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.25,CHS,142,0,0,0,,地面上有烧焦的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:29.59,CHS,143,0,0,0,,只可能是硝基甲烷造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:36.60,CHS,144,0,0,0,,洛杉矶只有一家卖这个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:43.81,CHS,145,0,0,0,,无论怎样她都不会复生 多姆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.19,CHS,146,0,0,0,,如果我是莱蒂 我会要你…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.28,0:22:51.86,CHS,147,0,0,0,,不 我求你 忘掉它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:55.12,CHS,148,0,0,0,,否则就太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.62,0:23:01.54,CHS,149,0,0,0,,已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.51,CHS,150,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.49,0:24:16.99,CHS,151,0,0,0,,特伦托小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:20.24,CHS,152,0,0,0,,我叫迈克尔·斯特萨克 联邦调查局的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:23.37,CHS,153,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:47.73,CHS,154,0,0,0,,我是证据组的福赛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.81,0:24:51.44,CHS,155,0,0,0,,我要斯特萨克来登记证人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.53,0:24:53.03,CHS,156,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:54.65,CHS,157,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:57.32,CHS,158,0,0,0,,我把范围缩小到50个大卫·帕克
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:59.78,CHS,159,0,0,0,,你要做的是查清他们每个的底细
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.87,0:25:00.83,CHS,160,0,0,0,,- 明白？ - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:02.16,CHS,161,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.80,0:25:15.09,CHS,162,0,0,0,,嘿 泰勒 我们换班了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:19.30,CHS,163,0,0,0,,和我来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:41.99,CHS,164,0,0,0,,特伦托
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.33,0:25:44.87,CHS,165,0,0,0,,你什么时候回来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.96,0:25:47.83,CHS,166,0,0,0,,我在找一辆你改造过引擎的车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:52.42,CHS,167,0,0,0,,硝基甲烷油箱 福特全尺寸 大陆牌轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:57.68,CHS,168,0,0,0,,听着 你在干什么？ 就这样大摇大摆地进来？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:00.89,CHS,169,0,0,0,,这不再是你的地盘了 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.97,0:26:03.68,CHS,170,0,0,0,,别再来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.77,0:26:06.10,CHS,171,0,0,0,,代我向你妹妹问好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.65,0:26:20.99,CHS,172,0,0,0,,一个韩国小子 大卫·帕克
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:24.16,CHS,173,0,0,0,,绿色福特都灵车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:27.50,CHS,174,0,0,0,,别砸我！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.38,0:26:34.09,CHS,175,0,0,0,,我吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.38,0:26:39.84,CHS,176,0,0,0,,何不告诉我你为何带我到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.97,0:26:49.85,CHS,177,0,0,0,,你知道他们要抓多姆 也许更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:55.86,CHS,178,0,0,0,,我不想你卷入这件事 所以离他远点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.78,0:27:00.15,CHS,179,0,0,0,,5年了 这就是你要对我说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.53,0:27:04.37,CHS,180,0,0,0,,突然间 你就关心起我了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:10.12,CHS,181,0,0,0,,我原来对不起你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.21,0:27:14.50,CHS,182,0,0,0,,我很遗憾 那是… 我所做的最困难的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.96,0:27:17.88,CHS,183,0,0,0,,我也很遗憾 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.51,0:27:23.26,CHS,184,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你闯进我家 假装爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.35,0:27:25.72,CHS,185,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你把我家搞得四分五裂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.81,0:27:28.72,CHS,186,0,0,0,,我非常遗憾这对你很难
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.44,0:27:34.06,CHS,187,0,0,0,,我对你撒了谎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:38.07,CHS,188,0,0,0,,我对多姆撒了谎 对所有人撒了谎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:41.82,CHS,189,0,0,0,,这是我拿手的 因此联邦调查局招我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.49,0:27:45.87,CHS,190,0,0,0,,也许你在对自己撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:50.83,CHS,191,0,0,0,,也许你不是装作坏人的好人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:54.67,CHS,192,0,0,0,,也许你是装作好人的坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.92,CHS,193,0,0,0,,你想过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:28:00.05,CHS,194,0,0,0,,每天都想
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:14.27,CHS,195,0,0,0,,我总在想
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:19.27,CHS,196,0,0,0,,那天你为什么让我哥哥走？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:22.28,CHS,197,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.21,0:28:33.62,CHS,198,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.75,0:28:37.75,CHS,199,0,0,0,,布莱恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:40.84,CHS,200,0,0,0,,我核查了大卫·帕克 列出了可能的名单
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.96,0:28:43.38,CHS,201,0,0,0,,- 上面有谁？ - 45岁男性 开06款Scion
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.47,0:28:45.55,CHS,202,0,0,0,,- 有三张罚单 - 不是他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:48.01,CHS,203,0,0,0,,- 01款雪佛兰塔荷 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:51.93,CHS,204,0,0,0,,两辆Mini Cooper 06和07款 丰田混合车
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.02,0:28:54.69,CHS,205,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 98款Saturn 95款Sebring
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:56.90,CHS,206,0,0,0,,98款尼桑240 非法改装过
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.98,CHS,207,0,0,0,,等等 就是它
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:01.57,CHS,208,0,0,0,,- 哪个？ - 非法改装的尼桑240
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.69,0:29:04.95,CHS,209,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 因为是我会开的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:30.85,CHS,210,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.48,0:29:45.19,CHS,211,0,0,0,,绿色都灵车 烧硝基甲烷
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:47.82,CHS,212,0,0,0,,- 谁的车？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.91,0:29:50.91,CHS,213,0,0,0,,我只是中间人 我发誓！ 我只是中间人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.75,0:29:57.46,CHS,214,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.04,0:30:01.84,CHS,215,0,0,0,,我不知道 我发誓 我只是给布拉加开车的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.92,0:30:04.71,CHS,216,0,0,0,,我能做的只有让你去参赛！ 就这些！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:06.17,CHS,217,0,0,0,,什么比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.64,0:30:13.39,CHS,218,0,0,0,,救命！抓住啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:15.85,CHS,219,0,0,0,,把我拉上去 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.03,0:30:29.86,CHS,220,0,0,0,,快点啊！我什么都不知道！拉我上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.95,0:30:32.12,CHS,221,0,0,0,,我说了 你要和布拉加去谈！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:33.16,CHS,222,0,0,0,,把他拉上来 多姆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:35.95,CHS,223,0,0,0,,天啊！别放下我！我只知道这些！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:38.54,CHS,224,0,0,0,,把他拉上来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.62,0:30:41.12,CHS,225,0,0,0,,你来抓我的 奥康纳？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.58,0:30:44.13,CHS,226,0,0,0,,- 靠！ - 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.01,0:30:48.72,CHS,227,0,0,0,,莱蒂也是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:50.43,CHS,228,0,0,0,,你没有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.51,0:30:53.64,CHS,229,0,0,0,,你们能不能以后再谈这个？ 快把我拉上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:56.01,CHS,230,0,0,0,,她在为这个布拉加做事 后来出了情况
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:57.14,CHS,231,0,0,0,,求求你！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.23,0:30:59.85,CHS,232,0,0,0,,我要抓住这帮人 多姆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:02.15,CHS,233,0,0,0,,让我来做我的工作 把他拉上来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.23,0:31:04.69,CHS,234,0,0,0,,我要杀了布拉加
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:07.82,CHS,235,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.24,0:31:10.99,CHS,236,0,0,0,,还有挡我道的人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.24,0:31:16.45,CHS,237,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:18.66,CHS,238,0,0,0,,别放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.55,0:31:28.84,CHS,239,0,0,0,,奥康纳！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.59,0:31:34.26,CHS,240,0,0,0,,奥康纳！如果你再放走我的证人…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:40.56,CHS,241,0,0,0,,- 够了！ - 别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.64,0:31:42.06,CHS,242,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:45.36,CHS,243,0,0,0,,- 你完了 奥康纳！ - 够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.86,0:31:48.40,CHS,244,0,0,0,,斯特萨克 去洗洗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:50.74,CHS,245,0,0,0,,什么？他先打我的 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.82,0:31:52.82,CHS,246,0,0,0,,这不是童子军！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.91,0:31:56.16,CHS,247,0,0,0,,快去！血滴到我的地板了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.75,0:32:08.59,CHS,248,0,0,0,,奥康纳？你知道警察和罪犯的区别吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:11.09,CHS,249,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 主观上的判断
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.59,0:32:14.76,CHS,250,0,0,0,,规矩点 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.72,0:32:20.47,CHS,251,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.48,0:32:25.15,CHS,252,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.07,0:32:33.70,CHS,253,0,0,0,,好消息 内线说布拉加的二把手 雷蒙·坎波斯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.78,0:32:35.95,CHS,254,0,0,0,,明晚要在韩国城举行街头车赛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.03,0:32:38.20,CHS,255,0,0,0,,为他的队伍选拔人才
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.74,0:32:41.41,CHS,256,0,0,0,,他们从前面的比赛中已经选中三个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.91,0:32:45.04,CHS,257,0,0,0,,我们最新的线人 大卫·帕克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.12,0:32:47.88,CHS,258,0,0,0,,让我们能够进入比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:52.59,CHS,259,0,0,0,,奥康纳 该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.42,0:32:56.01,CHS,260,0,0,0,,我猜是赢家获得位子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:04.31,CHS,261,0,0,0,,这就是本市扣押的车辆
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.39,0:33:06.52,CHS,262,0,0,0,,- 不错 - 挑一辆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:09.82,CHS,263,0,0,0,,2226号 我曾撞毁过一辆
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.90,0:33:14.57,CHS,264,0,0,0,,3418和2765号
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.91,0:33:17.86,CHS,265,0,0,0,,你选哪辆？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.95,0:33:19.66,CHS,266,0,0,0,,都要了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:51.44,CHS,267,0,0,0,,标准跟踪系统
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:53.44,CHS,268,0,0,0,,头要一直知道你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:47.16,CHS,269,0,0,0,,你想玩玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.16,0:34:49.29,CHS,270,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.67,0:34:52.08,CHS,271,0,0,0,,你在看什么 脓包？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:53.92,CHS,272,0,0,0,,不知道 你说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.00,0:34:56.25,CHS,273,0,0,0,,车手想要德怀特的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:59.30,CHS,274,0,0,0,,但是姑娘们 德怀特已经入选了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.34,CHS,275,0,0,0,,你要想给布拉加开车的话得快点
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.43,0:35:04.26,CHS,276,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗？ - 没
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.77,0:35:08.77,CHS,277,0,0,0,,你是帕克找来的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.85,0:35:10.35,CHS,278,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.10,0:35:12.56,CHS,279,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:17.69,CHS,280,0,0,0,,回头见 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.49,0:35:19.69,CHS,281,0,0,0,,你也是 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:34.21,CHS,282,0,0,0,,一击命中！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.26,0:35:41.47,CHS,283,0,0,0,,总能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:49.02,CHS,284,0,0,0,,你们都知道为什么到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.68,0:35:51.18,CHS,285,0,0,0,,好的车手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.85,0:35:54.65,CHS,286,0,0,0,,实在太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:59.36,CHS,287,0,0,0,,靠开车泡妞的人太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.19,0:36:03.20,CHS,288,0,0,0,,那不是布拉加让我找的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.78,0:36:08.45,CHS,289,0,0,0,,布拉加要的是能把一切抛在脑后的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:14.12,CHS,290,0,0,0,,不是规规矩矩地开跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.21,0:36:18.42,CHS,291,0,0,0,,而是穿过没人能去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:20.71,CHS,292,0,0,0,,真正的车手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.84,0:36:24.93,CHS,293,0,0,0,,我们运什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.93,0:36:29.35,CHS,294,0,0,0,,布拉加付钱 你没必要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.43,0:36:32.10,CHS,295,0,0,0,,你说你要真正的车手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:37.27,CHS,296,0,0,0,,真正的车手知道自己车里有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.32,0:36:44.11,CHS,297,0,0,0,,真正的车手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.99,0:36:48.20,CHS,298,0,0,0,,没人逼你去开车
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.28,0:36:50.04,CHS,299,0,0,0,,你是老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.79,0:36:54.08,CHS,300,0,0,0,,还是我和老大说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.04,0:36:58.96,CHS,301,0,0,0,,我看着像老大吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.17,0:37:04.72,CHS,302,0,0,0,,我的工作是找到最好的车手
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:08.47,CHS,303,0,0,0,,谁赢得比赛谁就能知道 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.39,0:37:14.94,CHS,304,0,0,0,,好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.15,0:37:18.81,CHS,305,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.32,0:37:21.32,CHS,306,0,0,0,,不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.03,0:37:24.19,CHS,307,0,0,0,,谁封闭街道？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.49,0:37:28.57,CHS,308,0,0,0,,没人 这是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:43.71,CHS,309,0,0,0,,导路下载中 请等待
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.47,0:37:51.93,CHS,310,0,0,0,,到加亮路线
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.68,0:37:53.81,CHS,311,0,0,0,,十
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.52,0:37:56.73,CHS,312,0,0,0,,九
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:37:59.56,CHS,313,0,0,0,,八
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.23,0:38:02.48,CHS,314,0,0,0,,七
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.86,0:38:05.03,CHS,315,0,0,0,,六…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.07,0:38:08.36,CHS,316,0,0,0,,- 你确定这么做？ - 很多事情变了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:11.16,CHS,317,0,0,0,,四… 说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.99,0:38:13.20,CHS,318,0,0,0,,…三
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.75,0:38:15.91,CHS,319,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.42,0:38:18.58,CHS,320,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.00,0:38:21.13,CHS,321,0,0,0,,出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.51,0:38:31.22,CHS,322,0,0,0,,前方右转
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.56,0:38:37.73,CHS,323,0,0,0,,距离目标5英里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.75,0:39:05.59,CHS,324,0,0,0,,我的屁股怎么样 小子？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.42,0:39:07.96,CHS,325,0,0,0,,犹太杂种
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.07,0:39:34.78,CHS,326,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:39.70,CHS,327,0,0,0,,快啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.00,0:39:42.79,CHS,328,0,0,0,,前方右转
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.77,0:40:02.94,CHS,329,0,0,0,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.23,0:40:09.53,CHS,330,0,0,0,,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.61,0:40:19.45,CHS,331,0,0,0,,重新计算路线
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.09,0:40:30.26,CHS,332,0,0,0,,前方直行
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.55,0:40:35.93,CHS,333,0,0,0,,重新计算路线
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.73,0:40:46.94,CHS,334,0,0,0,,靠
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:50.61,CHS,335,0,0,0,,- 重新计算路线 - 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.41,0:40:57.82,CHS,336,0,0,0,,距离目标2.6英里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:02.41,CHS,337,0,0,0,,啊…没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.87,0:41:08.88,CHS,338,0,0,0,,距离目标4.5英里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.58,0:41:44.45,CHS,339,0,0,0,,- U型转弯 可能的话 - 开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.54,0:41:48.58,CHS,340,0,0,0,,距离目标4.2英里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.42,0:41:51.84,CHS,341,0,0,0,,对不住了 爱车
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.14,0:42:01.64,CHS,342,0,0,0,,距离目标1英里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.72,0:42:03.93,CHS,343,0,0,0,,猜猜谁回来了 多姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.85,0:42:08.19,CHS,344,0,0,0,,加速！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.65,0:42:14.28,CHS,345,0,0,0,,车不错 宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:43:00.15,CHS,346,0,0,0,,贱人！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.49,0:43:04.58,CHS,347,0,0,0,,距离目标四分之一英里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.22,0:43:24.85,CHS,348,0,0,0,,太早啦 多姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.07,0:43:45.12,CHS,349,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.70,0:43:47.49,CHS,350,0,0,0,,还是个菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.91,0:43:54.04,CHS,351,0,0,0,,到达目的地 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.22,0:44:09.10,CHS,352,0,0,0,,至少你不耍赖赢不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.18,0:44:10.98,CHS,353,0,0,0,,我不知道规则一说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.94,0:44:14.65,CHS,354,0,0,0,,这就是我说的真正的车手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.73,0:44:16.11,CHS,355,0,0,0,,胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.19,0:44:18.15,CHS,356,0,0,0,,向你妈妈哭去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:22.57,CHS,357,0,0,0,,你现在为布拉加工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.99,0:44:25.78,CHS,358,0,0,0,,GPS呼叫时 你就跟着走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.79,0:44:32.58,CHS,359,0,0,0,,驾驶执照
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.67,0:44:35.25,CHS,360,0,0,0,,什么驾驶执照？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.79,0:44:37.34,CHS,361,0,0,0,,大拇指
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.01,0:44:43.80,CHS,362,0,0,0,,手机号码
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.89,0:44:51.10,CHS,363,0,0,0,,指纹是给坎波斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.77,0:44:53.64,CHS,364,0,0,0,,号码是给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.11,0:44:58.48,CHS,365,0,0,0,,脓包！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:45:02.15,CHS,366,0,0,0,,告诉你吧 那个肌肉男总能打败新来的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.24,0:45:05.03,CHS,367,0,0,0,,你听清了？总能打败！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.91,0:45:08.95,CHS,368,0,0,0,,姑娘们 回到德怀特叔叔这来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.58,0:45:18.63,CHS,369,0,0,0,,德怀特叔叔要你们脱鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.29,0:45:22.26,CHS,370,0,0,0,,德怀特喜欢美脚 脱鞋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.17,0:45:24.72,CHS,371,0,0,0,,真美
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.84,0:45:28.85,CHS,372,0,0,0,,德怀特太喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:38.56,CHS,373,0,0,0,,宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.73,0:45:41.94,CHS,374,0,0,0,,- 德怀特喜欢… - 联邦调查局的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.82,0:45:46.86,CHS,375,0,0,0,,我什么都没做 德怀特什么都没做！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.99,0:45:49.45,CHS,376,0,0,0,,- 别走！你们去哪？ - 再见了 德怀特！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.53,0:45:50.74,CHS,377,0,0,0,,我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.95,0:45:54.04,CHS,378,0,0,0,,你因为私藏毒品被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.12,0:45:57.46,CHS,379,0,0,0,,毒品？我从不碰那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.54,0:45:58.58,CHS,380,0,0,0,,现在碰了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.67,0:46:01.04,CHS,381,0,0,0,,那不是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.13,0:46:03.25,CHS,382,0,0,0,,你知道这从来站不住脚的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.34,0:46:05.59,CHS,383,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.34,0:46:10.26,CHS,384,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.73,0:47:07.24,CHS,385,0,0,0,,科罗娜啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.24,0:47:11.61,CHS,386,0,0,0,,德怀特太不幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.70,0:47:15.16,CHS,387,0,0,0,,你进入他们组织那晚联邦调查局 搜查了他的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:17.25,CHS,388,0,0,0,,真不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:20.75,CHS,389,0,0,0,,我想说我真没想到在这遇见你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.33,0:47:25.59,CHS,390,0,0,0,,怎样才能让我不告诉他们你是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.67,0:47:29.42,CHS,391,0,0,0,,和我不告诉他们你来这的真正目的 是一回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:31.72,CHS,392,0,0,0,,- 你们好吗 伙计们 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.80,0:47:34.47,CHS,393,0,0,0,,- 玩得开心吗？ - 很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.56,0:47:37.10,CHS,394,0,0,0,,跟我来 找点乐子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.64,0:47:41.19,CHS,395,0,0,0,,你的车怎么样了？撞得不轻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.27,0:47:42.81,CHS,396,0,0,0,,会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.90,0:47:46.23,CHS,397,0,0,0,,我听说你刚从牢里出来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.32,0:47:47.90,CHS,398,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.99,CHS,399,0,0,0,,听说过吉姆·加西亚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:54.12,CHS,400,0,0,0,,没有 地方大 很多名字 很多面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.62,0:47:58.66,CHS,401,0,0,0,,你 很多人要抓你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.75,0:48:01.33,CHS,402,0,0,0,,那可对生意不好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.42,0:48:04.33,CHS,403,0,0,0,,那要看你怎么看这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.42,0:48:06.79,CHS,404,0,0,0,,我被抓 我坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.84,0:48:09.51,CHS,405,0,0,0,,真的坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:15.09,CHS,406,0,0,0,,我不知道别人怎么样 只要我看到后面警车在追
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.18,0:48:16.68,CHS,407,0,0,0,,我可不会停
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.06,0:48:24.06,CHS,408,0,0,0,,你们两个认识吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.15,0:48:30.32,CHS,409,0,0,0,,他曾泡我妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.40,0:48:32.74,CHS,410,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:37.70,CHS,411,0,0,0,,- 你很走运 - 怎讲？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.74,0:48:40.75,CHS,412,0,0,0,,你还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.79,0:48:50.84,CHS,413,0,0,0,,为我们爱过和失去过的女人们干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.56,0:49:01.60,CHS,414,0,0,0,,布拉加怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.52,0:49:05.39,CHS,415,0,0,0,,他和我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.48,0:49:08.94,CHS,416,0,0,0,,发迹于街头 最后入狱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.02,0:49:11.23,CHS,417,0,0,0,,现在他是发号施令的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.07,0:49:13.95,CHS,418,0,0,0,,老大中的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.57,0:49:16.86,CHS,419,0,0,0,,瞧见这些人了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.45,0:49:20.12,CHS,420,0,0,0,,他们都愿意为布拉加去死
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.20,0:49:21.83,CHS,421,0,0,0,,包括你？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.96,0:49:25.58,CHS,422,0,0,0,,特别是我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:37.13,CHS,423,0,0,0,,好好玩 伙计们 这是你们的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.22,0:49:40.47,CHS,424,0,0,0,,不管你们要什么 美酒 佳人 都行
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.89,0:49:45.43,CHS,425,0,0,0,,布拉加是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.02,0:49:51.40,CHS,426,0,0,0,,我要把他们一网打尽
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.19,0:49:53.57,CHS,427,0,0,0,,好运
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.36,0:52:04.07,CHS,428,0,0,0,,对这辆车很感兴趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:06.95,CHS,429,0,0,0,,欣赏车身设计
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.54,0:52:12.54,CHS,430,0,0,0,,你是那种喜欢车胜过女人的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.00,0:52:20.71,CHS,431,0,0,0,,我是那种喜欢完美身形的人 不管是车还是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.39,0:52:25.85,CHS,432,0,0,0,,你的车？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.89,0:52:31.56,CHS,433,0,0,0,,菲尼克斯的车
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.77,0:52:36.86,CHS,434,0,0,0,,你会在接头地点见到他 他给你们领路
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:39.73,CHS,435,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.15,0:52:43.53,CHS,436,0,0,0,,我知道了你对车的品味
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.61,0:52:46.16,CHS,437,0,0,0,,告诉我 你的女人什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.16,0:52:50.33,CHS,438,0,0,0,,一切都是从眼睛开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:58.00,CHS,439,0,0,0,,她那双眼睛能穿过浮夸的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.09,0:53:00.21,CHS,440,0,0,0,,看到一个人的本质
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.84,0:53:08.01,CHS,441,0,0,0,,二分天使 八分魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:11.52,CHS,442,0,0,0,,来到人间
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.35,0:53:17.52,CHS,443,0,0,0,,一点都不怕指甲上沾上机油
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.49,0:53:27.11,CHS,444,0,0,0,,听起来一点都不像我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.78,0:53:31.12,CHS,445,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.21,0:53:40.21,CHS,446,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.30,0:53:43.38,CHS,447,0,0,0,,- 送你个礼物 - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.47,0:53:46.01,CHS,448,0,0,0,,脏酒杯 我一直想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.09,0:53:47.68,CHS,449,0,0,0,,我昨晚从俱乐部弄来的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.76,0:53:49.72,CHS,450,0,0,0,,他们两个的指纹都在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.80,0:53:53.31,CHS,451,0,0,0,,我知道一个是坎波斯的 另一个很可能是布拉加的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.39,0:53:55.94,CHS,452,0,0,0,,你要联系国际刑警组织
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.02,0:53:58.40,CHS,453,0,0,0,,那意味着我要联系每一位探员
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:54:01.02,CHS,454,0,0,0,,这要好几周时间 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.12,0:54:17.08,CHS,455,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.17,0:54:20.33,CHS,456,0,0,0,,不到3个街区你就3次违章了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.42,0:54:22.42,CHS,457,0,0,0,,慢点 奥康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.09,0:54:24.80,CHS,458,0,0,0,,没问题 老爹
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.87,0:54:54.95,CHS,459,0,0,0,,他停下了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.59,0:55:51.01,CHS,460,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.09,0:55:52.59,CHS,461,0,0,0,,他关掉了跟踪器 我们还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:54.93,CHS,462,0,0,0,,我告诉你 他关掉了跟踪器 我们还不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.01,0:55:56.93,CHS,463,0,0,0,,直升机出动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.06,0:56:01.10,CHS,464,0,0,0,,正向北飞行 33度56分
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.11,0:56:06.48,CHS,465,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.42,0:56:31.72,CHS,466,0,0,0,,呼叫总部
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.80,0:56:35.43,CHS,467,0,0,0,,没发现目标 重复 没发现目标
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.51,0:56:37.22,CHS,468,0,0,0,,他们走了 那下面没人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.31,0:56:38.64,CHS,469,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.69,0:56:54.49,CHS,470,0,0,0,,这不对 老兄 没人说过被锁在卡车里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.57,0:56:56.32,CHS,471,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:00.83,CHS,472,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.54,0:57:05.58,CHS,473,0,0,0,,你认为他们带我们去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.67,0:57:07.25,CHS,474,0,0,0,,无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.17,0:57:13.01,CHS,475,0,0,0,,我们现在只是凑热闹的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.10,0:57:26.10,CHS,476,0,0,0,,欢迎来到墨西哥 小伙子们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.86,0:57:34.24,CHS,477,0,0,0,,直升机和监视摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.32,0:57:36.78,CHS,478,0,0,0,,扫描边界的热信号
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.87,0:57:40.83,CHS,479,0,0,0,,但是存在盲点 通过卫星我可以引导你们穿过去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.91,0:57:45.41,CHS,480,0,0,0,,绝对不能犯错 因此你们必须遵守指示
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.12,0:57:47.50,CHS,481,0,0,0,,有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.54,0:57:52.09,CHS,482,0,0,0,,我认为菲尼克斯会在那
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.26,0:57:57.34,CHS,483,0,0,0,,他在外面等你们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.22,0:58:04.56,CHS,484,0,0,0,,好啦 大家同步
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.35,0:58:09.23,CHS,485,0,0,0,,好运 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.66,0:58:24.24,CHS,486,0,0,0,,卫星已连接
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.58,0:58:28.62,CHS,487,0,0,0,,以当前速度前往北部边界
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.59,0:58:34.46,CHS,488,0,0,0,,跟紧菲尼克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.63,0:58:37.09,CHS,489,0,0,0,,他将带你们穿过边境
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.27,0:58:54.82,CHS,490,0,0,0,,隆加多峡谷北侧发现热信号
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:59:01.82,CHS,491,0,0,0,,墨西哥一侧的热信号窗口要关闭45秒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.91,0:59:03.78,CHS,492,0,0,0,,使用摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.87,0:59:07.70,CHS,493,0,0,0,,人工操作 设定摄像头到指定坐标
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.88,0:59:13.67,CHS,494,0,0,0,,快点 你们被盯上了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.47,0:59:24.81,CHS,495,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:28.39,CHS,496,0,0,0,,特伦托 获取背后情况
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.56,0:59:32.65,CHS,497,0,0,0,,重新成像开始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.45,0:59:43.37,CHS,498,0,0,0,,什么都没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.45,0:59:44.66,CHS,499,0,0,0,,他们跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.70,0:59:48.66,CHS,500,0,0,0,,派直升机去监视
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.75,0:59:55.88,CHS,501,0,0,0,,总部 我们离开隆加多峡谷40秒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.75,0:59:58.38,CHS,502,0,0,0,,他们派了直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:01.88,CHS,503,0,0,0,,你们有30秒时间
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.69,1:00:13.81,CHS,504,0,0,0,,北纬32度33分 西经116度49分
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.32,1:00:22.11,CHS,505,0,0,0,,窗口很快就要关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.20,1:00:25.37,CHS,506,0,0,0,,你们要在他们派出地面支援之前离开那
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.58,1:00:33.25,CHS,507,0,0,0,,15秒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.71,1:00:41.05,CHS,508,0,0,0,,总部 距离目标2英里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.23,1:00:56.44,CHS,509,0,0,0,,你们没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.48,1:01:01.57,CHS,510,0,0,0,,你们快离开那！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.54,1:01:17.54,CHS,511,0,0,0,,总部 我们在北纬32度33分 西经116度49分
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.63,1:01:21.51,CHS,512,0,0,0,,没发现目标 出动地面部队以确认
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:43.78,CHS,513,0,0,0,,慢！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.45,1:01:45.99,CHS,514,0,0,0,,太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.62,1:01:53.66,CHS,515,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.17,1:01:57.50,CHS,516,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.63,1:02:01.96,CHS,517,0,0,0,,出来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:06.68,CHS,518,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.76,1:02:08.72,CHS,519,0,0,0,,快点 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.80,1:02:10.68,CHS,520,0,0,0,,嘿 别碰我！嘿 别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.06,1:02:13.77,CHS,521,0,0,0,,我说别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.85,1:02:15.39,CHS,522,0,0,0,,把手从我身上拿开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.48,1:02:16.98,CHS,523,0,0,0,,马利克
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.10,1:02:18.31,CHS,524,0,0,0,,你们怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.40,1:02:20.27,CHS,525,0,0,0,,嘿 老大！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.19,1:02:24.90,CHS,526,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.99,1:02:28.74,CHS,527,0,0,0,,我说只有脓包用硝基甲烷
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.37,1:02:33.45,CHS,528,0,0,0,,你检查过我的车？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.33,1:02:42.04,CHS,529,0,0,0,,在和你说话呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.13,1:02:44.34,CHS,530,0,0,0,,你在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.17,1:02:46.51,CHS,531,0,0,0,,70款普利茅斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.51,1:02:50.80,CHS,532,0,0,0,,她叫莱蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.31,CHS,534,0,0,0,,我的钱呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.02,1:03:02.36,CHS,535,0,0,0,,有人撞毁了她的车
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.16,1:03:11.41,CHS,536,0,0,0,,我撞的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.00,1:03:17.04,CHS,537,0,0,0,,你还记得那张脸吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.79,1:03:23.79,CHS,538,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.67,1:03:26.30,CHS,539,0,0,0,,我可忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.67,1:03:30.34,CHS,540,0,0,0,,上次我见到它 在燃烧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.15,1:03:45.52,CHS,541,0,0,0,,现在又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.15,1:03:49.90,CHS,542,0,0,0,,我会享受接下来这一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.98,1:04:25.48,CHS,543,0,0,0,,多姆 上车！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.77,1:04:28.44,CHS,544,0,0,0,,快上车！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.44,1:04:34.28,CHS,545,0,0,0,,快点！快上车！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.27,1:05:02.89,CHS,546,0,0,0,,发现了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.98,1:05:05.56,CHS,547,0,0,0,,我们在联系各国的特工
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.65,1:05:10.65,CHS,548,0,0,0,,很不幸 他们大多数都要手动 扫描指纹上传
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.49,1:05:13.57,CHS,549,0,0,0,,奥康纳在5号线
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:15.74,CHS,550,0,0,0,,长官 您看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.82,1:05:17.32,CHS,551,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.71,1:05:28.84,CHS,552,0,0,0,,讲话 奥康纳
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.30,1:05:31.46,CHS,553,0,0,0,,- 你到底去哪了？ - 我拿到货了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.55,1:05:34.55,CHS,554,0,0,0,,“我拿到货” 还是“我们拿到货”？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.63,1:05:36.68,CHS,555,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.76,1:05:41.22,CHS,556,0,0,0,,交通监视器录到你和特伦托在一起的画面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.35,1:05:47.10,CHS,557,0,0,0,,听者 奥康纳 把货带来 把特伦托带来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.52,1:05:50.19,CHS,558,0,0,0,,但我认为目标是布拉加 我们现在有机会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.27,1:05:52.86,CHS,559,0,0,0,,布莱恩 没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.74,1:05:56.03,CHS,560,0,0,0,,把他们带来 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.37,1:06:01.70,CHS,561,0,0,0,,奥康纳？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.71,1:06:14.55,CHS,562,0,0,0,,六千万就是这样子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.30,1:06:18.93,CHS,563,0,0,0,,嗯 你得去找医生看看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.01,1:06:21.68,CHS,564,0,0,0,,我们要找个地方把它藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.27,1:06:25.43,CHS,565,0,0,0,,我有个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.53,1:06:38.45,CHS,566,0,0,0,,502号 酒后驾车 需要48小时扣押
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.57,1:06:42.41,CHS,567,0,0,0,,找个地方吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.58,1:06:49.46,CHS,568,0,0,0,,这没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.42,1:06:56.59,CHS,569,0,0,0,,是的 他们最不会搜查的地方 就是自己的押车场 相信我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.10,1:07:04.97,CHS,570,0,0,0,,我在想…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.06,1:07:07.52,CHS,571,0,0,0,,你炸毁你的车的时候 把我的也炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.60,1:07:10.10,CHS,572,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.19,1:07:12.77,CHS,573,0,0,0,,你欠我一辆跑车
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.11,1:07:16.36,CHS,574,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.62,1:07:29.33,CHS,575,0,0,0,,现在扯平了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.01,1:07:47.89,CHS,576,0,0,0,,你就这样让我离他远点？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.02,1:07:51.85,CHS,577,0,0,0,,- 你是我唯一能求助的人 - 他是我哥哥 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.49,1:08:01.57,CHS,578,0,0,0,,子弹不在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.12,1:08:13.08,CHS,579,0,0,0,,我要清洗干净然后缝上 会有点疼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.17,1:08:15.63,CHS,580,0,0,0,,我打赌你很享受这个
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.30,1:08:17.63,CHS,581,0,0,0,,有点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.59,1:08:23.01,CHS,582,0,0,0,,- 要这个吗？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.09,1:08:25.14,CHS,583,0,0,0,,辣的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.89,1:08:28.52,CHS,584,0,0,0,,我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.64,1:08:31.85,CHS,585,0,0,0,,多姆 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.94,1:08:34.85,CHS,586,0,0,0,,你太着急了 要先祈祷的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:49.04,CHS,587,0,0,0,,感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.50,1:08:55.25,CHS,588,0,0,0,,赐给我们食物 家庭和友情
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.99,1:09:31.33,CHS,589,0,0,0,,你问我为什么放走多姆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.41,1:09:36.08,CHS,590,0,0,0,,我想是因为那个时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.79,1:09:40.63,CHS,591,0,0,0,,我尊重他胜过我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.01,1:09:46.22,CHS,592,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:52.93,CHS,593,0,0,0,,我从多姆身上学到的是 什么都不重要 除非你有准则
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.15,1:09:58.44,CHS,594,0,0,0,,你的准则是什么 布莱恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.82,1:10:02.61,CHS,595,0,0,0,,正在找呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:39.02,CHS,596,0,0,0,,不好 嘿 多姆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:41.69,CHS,597,0,0,0,,- 你打算什么时候告诉我？ - 多姆 你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.77,1:10:43.73,CHS,598,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候告诉我 是你在背后指使莱蒂？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.82,1:10:46.15,CHS,599,0,0,0,,- 让我解释… - 你打算什么时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:52.87,CHS,600,0,0,0,,多姆 住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.95,1:10:55.12,CHS,601,0,0,0,,- 你不明白 - 我不明白？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.20,1:10:56.41,CHS,602,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.58,1:11:01.79,CHS,603,0,0,0,,她是为了…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.88,1:11:06.42,CHS,604,0,0,0,,多姆 住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.51,1:11:08.63,CHS,605,0,0,0,,住手！拜托！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.06,1:11:21.69,CHS,606,0,0,0,,她是为你 多姆！为你！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.19,1:11:30.53,CHS,607,0,0,0,,莱蒂来找我要以为布拉加运货 来交换把你的名字从名单上除去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.58,1:11:36.08,CHS,608,0,0,0,,她是为了让你回家！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.26,1:11:55.05,CHS,609,0,0,0,,对不起 多姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.14,1:11:56.56,CHS,610,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.42,1:12:27.25,CHS,611,0,0,0,,你最好有个解释 你直接违抗命令
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.13,1:12:30.13,CHS,612,0,0,0,,- 货在哪？ - 很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.22,1:12:32.01,CHS,613,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.09,1:12:34.97,CHS,614,0,0,0,,听者 我们可以拿这批货在媒体宣传
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.05,1:12:36.97,CHS,615,0,0,0,,说是从街头查获了几百磅海洛因
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.06,1:12:40.77,CHS,616,0,0,0,,但是布拉加以后还会运更多的货进来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.85,1:12:42.98,CHS,617,0,0,0,,我们用这批货把布拉加引出来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.06,1:12:45.10,CHS,618,0,0,0,,把他们的头抓住
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.19,1:12:47.57,CHS,619,0,0,0,,我们怎样做？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.65,1:12:49.61,CHS,620,0,0,0,,和布拉加面对面交易
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.69,1:12:51.07,CHS,621,0,0,0,,他从不出现
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.15,1:12:52.95,CHS,622,0,0,0,,他不得不露面
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.08,1:13:04.75,CHS,623,0,0,0,,你有计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.25,1:13:07.92,CHS,624,0,0,0,,我们谈个交易
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.80,1:13:13.59,CHS,625,0,0,0,,我们抓住布拉加 你放了特伦托
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.39,1:13:24.60,CHS,626,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 我是多姆
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.65,1:13:27.94,CHS,627,0,0,0,,我正想你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.32,1:13:32.24,CHS,628,0,0,0,,我给你我的号码的时候 希望你能打过来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.82,1:13:35.36,CHS,629,0,0,0,,但不是这种情况下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.70,1:13:38.83,CHS,630,0,0,0,,什么情况下？我活着？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.87,1:13:41.83,CHS,631,0,0,0,,别对个人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.33,1:13:44.25,CHS,632,0,0,0,,这是公事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.33,1:13:45.92,CHS,633,0,0,0,,我自己有点公事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.21,1:13:48.67,CHS,634,0,0,0,,让坎波斯接电话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.17,1:13:52.59,CHS,635,0,0,0,,是他们
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.93,1:13:57.93,CHS,636,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.18,1:14:02.18,CHS,637,0,0,0,,布拉加就这样表现诚意？ 卸磨杀驴？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:05.02,CHS,638,0,0,0,,总能找到更多的车手
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:07.27,CHS,639,0,0,0,,这是个好生意
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.52,1:14:08.77,CHS,640,0,0,0,,我要做笔交易
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.06,1:14:11.11,CHS,641,0,0,0,,布拉加从不谈判
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.19,1:14:12.19,CHS,642,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.28,1:14:17.16,CHS,643,0,0,0,,你向他解释六千万的货怎么就不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.87,1:14:20.16,CHS,644,0,0,0,,我知道这对生意可不好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.24,1:14:22.79,CHS,645,0,0,0,,你想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.29,1:14:27.54,CHS,646,0,0,0,,六百万现金 布拉加亲自送过来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.21,1:14:31.84,CHS,647,0,0,0,,我可不想当靶子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.21,1:14:35.47,CHS,648,0,0,0,,我可不想冒生命危险 除非他也冒险前来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.55,1:14:37.13,CHS,649,0,0,0,,他不会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.22,1:14:40.85,CHS,650,0,0,0,,或者我和布拉加打交道 或者你去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.85,1:14:46.39,CHS,651,0,0,0,,时间和地点？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.45,1:15:05.37,CHS,652,0,0,0,,队员已经就位 周围待命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.83,1:15:08.41,CHS,653,0,0,0,,听者 所有人待命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.50,1:15:11.17,CHS,654,0,0,0,,接到奥康纳信号前不得行动
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.25,1:15:13.96,CHS,655,0,0,0,,他拿到钱的时候 我们知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.55,1:15:17.01,CHS,656,0,0,0,,好消息是 我们抓住这家伙时
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:19.51,CHS,657,0,0,0,,你就自由了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.89,1:15:21.30,CHS,658,0,0,0,,他们这样和你说的？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.39,1:15:23.01,CHS,659,0,0,0,,是的 这是协议
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.10,1:15:26.52,CHS,660,0,0,0,,你还信圣诞老人这回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.81,1:15:28.98,CHS,661,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.77,1:15:34.86,CHS,662,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.94,1:15:37.03,CHS,663,0,0,0,,以防万一
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.99,1:15:44.03,CHS,664,0,0,0,,像以前一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.12,1:15:45.41,CHS,665,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:50.29,CHS,666,0,0,0,,你掉东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.37,1:15:52.54,CHS,667,0,0,0,,- 这就是你想要的？ - 多姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.64,1:16:10.27,CHS,668,0,0,0,,他没恶意 别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.02,1:16:14.52,CHS,669,0,0,0,,他真的为莱蒂遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.65,1:16:18.44,CHS,670,0,0,0,,我们的货呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.20,1:16:24.49,CHS,671,0,0,0,,曾经在这里面的货吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.66,1:16:29.45,CHS,672,0,0,0,,我们见到布拉加 你就能见到货 这是协议
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.41,1:16:31.83,CHS,673,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.21,1:16:34.21,CHS,674,0,0,0,,布拉加守信的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.21,1:17:19.71,CHS,675,0,0,0,,二百万
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.80,1:17:23.55,CHS,676,0,0,0,,我拿到我的东西后给你们剩下的钱
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.89,1:17:29.51,CHS,677,0,0,0,,- 斯特萨克 - 我们找到匹配了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.60,1:17:31.64,CHS,678,0,0,0,,指纹100%是布拉加的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.73,1:17:34.19,CHS,679,0,0,0,,正等待传真面部确认
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.27,1:17:36.23,CHS,680,0,0,0,,我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.31,1:17:40.07,CHS,681,0,0,0,,你越狱时候穿的是粉的？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.32,1:17:42.78,CHS,682,0,0,0,,所有特警准备行动
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.86,1:17:45.99,CHS,683,0,0,0,,我们得到确认 头号疑犯身着灰色西装
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.07,1:17:47.07,CHS,684,0,0,0,,行动
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.16,1:17:49.08,CHS,685,0,0,0,,长官 奥康纳还没给出信号
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:52.50,CHS,686,0,0,0,,你哪部分不明白？ 我们刚得到确认 快行动！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.58,1:17:55.92,CHS,687,0,0,0,,头号疑犯身着灰色西装 重复！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:58.58,CHS,688,0,0,0,,头号疑犯身着灰色西装
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.06,1:18:14.77,CHS,689,0,0,0,,你在想我在想什么 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.56,1:18:19.19,CHS,690,0,0,0,,他不是布拉加
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.78,1:18:24.78,CHS,691,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.95,1:18:27.20,CHS,692,0,0,0,,放下武器！联邦调查局的！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.61,1:18:28.91,CHS,693,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.41,1:18:34.12,CHS,694,0,0,0,,离开这！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.21,1:18:40.08,CHS,695,0,0,0,,离开这 多姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.38,1:18:45.97,CHS,696,0,0,0,,撞死他
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.47,1:18:47.68,CHS,697,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:50.01,CHS,698,0,0,0,,坎波斯就是布拉加！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.48,1:18:58.77,CHS,699,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.15,1:19:08.28,CHS,700,0,0,0,,接近头号目标中
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.82,1:19:10.99,CHS,701,0,0,0,,疑犯安全
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.66,1:19:15.45,CHS,702,0,0,0,,全程他都在你们鼻子底下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.00,1:19:17.75,CHS,703,0,0,0,,现在布拉加跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.83,1:19:20.79,CHS,704,0,0,0,,特伦托向南边跑了 很可能越过了边界
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.88,1:19:23.09,CHS,705,0,0,0,,你知道你惹了什么麻烦吗 奥康纳先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.17,1:19:25.13,CHS,706,0,0,0,,我在做我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.21,1:19:27.76,CHS,707,0,0,0,,他不是第一个你协助逃脱法律制裁的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:29.80,CHS,708,0,0,0,,你被停职了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.89,1:19:32.85,CHS,709,0,0,0,,直到举行正式听证会
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.02,1:19:36.77,CHS,710,0,0,0,,布拉加呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.85,1:19:40.19,CHS,711,0,0,0,,你不用再操心了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:52.07,CHS,712,0,0,0,,我们知道了布拉加在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.16,1:19:55.62,CHS,713,0,0,0,,海关通过卫星追踪他到他的老巢 墨西哥的台卡利
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.70,1:19:58.12,CHS,714,0,0,0,,我们在墨西哥没有执法权
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.92,1:20:02.50,CHS,715,0,0,0,,事实是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.58,1:20:06.67,CHS,716,0,0,0,,官员们忙着召开新闻发布会解释这次抓捕
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.76,1:20:08.88,CHS,717,0,0,0,,我们在背后行动
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.34,1:20:12.38,CHS,718,0,0,0,,我认为我们的工作是做正确的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.76,1:20:52.88,CHS,719,0,0,0,,大家都在找你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.26,1:20:54.89,CHS,720,0,0,0,,我就在这
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.18,1:20:57.51,CHS,721,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你走出往事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.60,1:21:01.18,CHS,722,0,0,0,,换成了电子燃料注入 看上去不错
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.31,1:21:04.40,CHS,723,0,0,0,,菜鸟成专家了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.48,1:21:10.28,CHS,724,0,0,0,,我和你去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.20,1:21:16.87,CHS,725,0,0,0,,我没打算带任何人回来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.83,1:21:20.16,CHS,726,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.92,1:21:30.59,CHS,727,0,0,0,,按下阀门
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.87,1:21:57.99,CHS,728,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.78,1:22:42.79,CHS,729,0,0,0,,你怎样和你唯一的哥哥道别？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.96,1:22:46.37,CHS,730,0,0,0,,你不需要
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.28,1:23:57.65,CHS,731,0,0,0,,我以为你不会出现的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.74,1:23:59.36,CHS,732,0,0,0,,你救了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.24,1:24:02.70,CHS,733,0,0,0,,我想还你个情
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.58,1:24:09.08,CHS,734,0,0,0,,这会帮你找到布拉加
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.29,1:24:14.38,CHS,735,0,0,0,,多姆
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.38,1:24:18.01,CHS,736,0,0,0,,去那是自杀
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.56,1:24:28.31,CHS,737,0,0,0,,我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.90,1:24:34.35,CHS,738,0,0,0,,你一定很爱她
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.42,1:24:55.13,CHS,739,0,0,0,,我的权力到这就结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.92,1:25:03.09,CHS,740,0,0,0,,我的才刚开始
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.02,1:26:06.07,CHS,741,0,0,0,,- 欢迎来到布拉加阁下的房子 - 别担心 神父 一切都会好起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.17,1:26:14.67,CHS,742,0,0,0,,帮我们去天堂
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.43,1:26:30.97,CHS,743,0,0,0,,请接收这份祝福
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.47,1:27:15.35,CHS,744,0,0,0,,你不会被宽恕的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.81,1:27:20.98,CHS,745,0,0,0,,你们要逮捕我？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.06,1:27:23.94,CHS,746,0,0,0,,在这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.03,1:27:26.07,CHS,747,0,0,0,,不 远不止
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.15,1:27:29.95,CHS,748,0,0,0,,这次你跑不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.32,1:27:32.99,CHS,749,0,0,0,,你和我…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.20,1:27:37.04,CHS,750,0,0,0,,你和我没什么不同
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.79,1:27:40.37,CHS,751,0,0,0,,你不是英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.01,1:27:52.68,CHS,752,0,0,0,,说得没错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.81,1:27:59.14,CHS,753,0,0,0,,所以你逃回了边界
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.15,1:28:06.86,CHS,754,0,0,0,,菲尼克斯是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.86,1:28:08.94,CHS,755,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.22,1:28:32.34,CHS,756,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.39,1:28:40.93,CHS,757,0,0,0,,如果你能跑出两英里 算你走运
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.49,1:29:35.74,CHS,758,0,0,0,,你知道你要去哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.78,1:29:38.95,CHS,759,0,0,0,,想借我的GPS？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.66,1:29:44.37,CHS,760,0,0,0,,你的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.46,1:29:46.00,CHS,761,0,0,0,,还出不出现？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.46,1:29:51.51,CHS,762,0,0,0,,你得小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.81,1:30:10.02,CHS,763,0,0,0,,停车 停车吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.58,1:30:24.83,CHS,764,0,0,0,,别打着老板 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.21,1:30:31.92,CHS,765,0,0,0,,就在你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.77,1:30:49.86,CHS,766,0,0,0,,多姆 前往隧道 我们利用隧道
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.09,1:31:19.05,CHS,767,0,0,0,,离开这 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.81,1:31:30.31,CHS,768,0,0,0,,你确定知道隧道在哪？确定吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.86,1:31:32.61,CHS,769,0,0,0,,是的 我会抓紧点
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.69,1:31:37.36,CHS,770,0,0,0,,这可能会疼
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.75,1:31:52.92,CHS,771,0,0,0,,现在到我的地盘了 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.53,1:32:24.07,CHS,772,0,0,0,,就这样 宝贝！前面没路了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.16,1:32:25.62,CHS,773,0,0,0,,现在想怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.41,1:32:27.49,CHS,774,0,0,0,,玩完了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.58,1:32:29.12,CHS,775,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.73,1:33:00.15,CHS,776,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.36,1:34:20.44,CHS,777,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.57,1:34:23.40,CHS,778,0,0,0,,那我弄出来！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.53,1:35:54.95,CHS,779,0,0,0,,脓包
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:13.97,CHS,780,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.52,1:36:18.89,CHS,781,0,0,0,,压住
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.56,1:36:21.56,CHS,782,0,0,0,,你会没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.44,1:36:29.53,CHS,783,0,0,0,,你得离开这
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.16,1:36:34.16,CHS,784,0,0,0,,我不再逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.79,1:36:41.87,CHS,785,0,0,0,,我问你件事
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.54,1:36:43.67,CHS,786,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.42,1:36:48.46,CHS,787,0,0,0,,你知道如果你不作弊 那次赛车我就赢了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.55,1:36:53.47,CHS,788,0,0,0,,你头撞得不轻吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.35,1:37:00.23,CHS,789,0,0,0,,别让我笑了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.90,1:37:12.28,CHS,790,0,0,0,,全体起立
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.58,1:37:19.29,CHS,791,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.54,1:37:25.58,CHS,792,0,0,0,,请起立 特伦托先生
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.96,1:37:30.26,CHS,793,0,0,0,,我听了证词
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:32.88,CHS,794,0,0,0,,特别考虑了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.97,1:37:36.97,CHS,795,0,0,0,,奥康纳探员为特伦托先生的请愿
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.93,1:37:40.60,CHS,796,0,0,0,,他的行为直接导致大毒枭
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.68,1:37:43.52,CHS,797,0,0,0,,阿图罗·布拉加的被捕
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.06,1:37:46.44,CHS,798,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.73,1:37:49.69,CHS,799,0,0,0,,司法部认为
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.78,1:37:54.61,CHS,800,0,0,0,,一件正确的事不能弥补一生犯下的错
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.28,1:37:57.03,CHS,801,0,0,0,,因此
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.12,1:38:02.12,CHS,802,0,0,0,,我不得不按加州法律判最终刑期
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.54,1:38:06.21,CHS,803,0,0,0,,多米尼克·特伦托
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.04,1:38:11.05,CHS,804,0,0,0,,你被判在隆波克监狱
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.13,1:38:14.22,CHS,805,0,0,0,,最高安全等级监禁25年
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.97,1:38:17.76,CHS,806,0,0,0,,不得假释
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.35,1:38:20.18,CHS,807,0,0,0,,休庭
